The reasoning component allows it to analyze trends, correlate different pieces of information,
and also make informed decisions under uncertainty.

192
00:23:35,054 --> 00:23:48,580
例如，如果智能体观察到利率上升和消费者信心下降的组合，
其推理模块可能会推断出市场可能出现低迷，并调整其交易策略以降低风险。
For example, if the agent observes a combination of rising interest rates and also declining consumer confidence,
its reasoning module might infer a potential downturn in the market and also adjust its trading strategy to mitigate risk.

193
00:23:49,390 --> 00:23:51,744
