528
01:11:39,936 --> 01:11:49,296
这条技术支持路径可能涉及评估知识库、故障排除、指南，甚至将客户与人工支持代理连接起来。
This technical support path might involve assessing knowledge bases, troubleshooting, guides,
or even connecting the customer with a human support agent.

529
01:11:49,614 --> 01:11:56,176
类似的与订单跟踪或产品信息相关的查询可能会被路由到各自的专门分支。
Similar queries related to order tracking or product information could be routed to their respective specialized branches.

530
01:11:56,366 --> 01:12:08,736
条件聚合器随后将确保无论回复是退款确认、故障排除步骤还是订单跟踪详情，
都能以清晰且一致的方式呈现给客户。
The conditional aggregator would then ensure that the response, whether it's confirmation of a refund, troubleshooting steps,
or order tracking details, is presented to the customer in a clear and consistent manner.

531
01:12:08,896 --> 01:12:22,096
这种将不同类型的查询路由到定制处理路径的能力，显著提高了 Gen AI 工作流的效率和效果，
为用户提供更准确、更相关的回复。
This ability to route different types of inquiries to tailored processing paths significantly improves the efficiency and
effectiveness of Gen AI workflows, leading to more accurate and relevant responses for the users.

532
01:12:22,286 --> 01:12:33,296
总之，条件模式路由赋予了 Gen AI 工作流根据特定条件或输入做出决策并调整执行的能力。
In summary, the conditional pattern routing empowers Gen AI workflows with the ability
to make decisions and adapt their executions based on specific conditions or input.

533
01:12:33,456 --> 01:12:46,650
