无论是安全性、合规性、可扩展性还是可靠性，Langchain 都旨在满足现实世界组织的生产级要
求，使其能够部署到大规模环境中。
Whether it's security, compliance, scalability, or reliability, Langchain is designed to meet the production level requirements of
real-world organizations, making it ready for deployment in large-scale environments.

787
01:42:12,174 --> 01:42:16,452
了解 Langchain 的功能是一回事，但让我们把它具体化。
Understanding what Langchain does is one thing, but let's make it concrete.

788
01:42:16,910 --> 01:42:18,864
实际的用例有哪些？
What are the actual use cases?

789
01:42:19,182 --> 01:42:22,180
Langchain 在实际应用中是如何被应用的？
Where is Langchain being applied in real applications?

790
01:42:22,798 --> 01:42:25,668
一个主要的用例是工作流自动化。
One major use case is workflow automation.

791
01:42:26,414 --> 01:42:32,132
工作流允许你将语言模型与工具和 APIs 连接起来，创建自动化工作流。
Workflow allows you to connect language models with tools and APIs to create automated workflows.

792
01:42:32,846 --> 01:42:47,684
想想从多个来源检索数据、基于实时数据自动生成报告、基于内容分析的智能任务路由，
以及 LLM 协调不同服务的系统编排。
Think data retrieval from multiple sources, automated report generation based on real-time data,
intelligent task routing based on content analysis, and system orchestration where the LLM coordinates different services.

793
01:42:48,462 --> 01:42:53,124
模型变成了受控流程的一部分，而不仅仅是回答问题。
The model becomes part of a controlled process rather than just answering questions.

794
01:42:53,614 --> 01:42:57,732
另一个重要的应用场景是构建智能对话智能体。
Another important use case is building intelligent conversational agents.

795
01:42:58,446 --> 01:43:01,604
这些不是只会检索固定回答的简单聊天机器人。
These aren't simple chatbots that retrieve canned responses.

796
01:43:02,094 --> 01:43:10,724
这些是能够推理复杂用户请求、决定需要使用哪些工具并在对话中采取行动的助手。
These are assistants that can reason through complex user requests, decide
which tools they need to use, and take actions during a conversation.

797
01:43:11,246 --> 01:43:18,212
用户可能会问：帮我找出所有六个月没下单的客户，并给他们发一封带折扣码的邮件。
A user might ask, find me all customers who haven't placed an order in six months and email them a discount code.

798
01:43:18,670 --> 01:43:26,820
智能体会理解这个请求，查询数据库，生成个性化邮件，并通过自然对话把它们全部发出去。
The agent understands this, queries the database, generates personalized emails, and sends them all through natural conversation.

799
01:43:27,246 --> 01:43:31,504
Langchain 也广泛用于动态和自适应的应用。
Langchain is also widely used for dynamic and adaptive applications.

800
01:43:31,744 --> 01:43:36,740
这些应用能够响应实时数据的变化和不断变化的用户上下文。
These applications respond to real-time data changes and evolving user context.

801
01:43:37,646 --> 01:43:50,660
Langchain 帮助管理状态，让应用记住发生了什么，提供记忆功能以便它能回想起相关的过去交
互，并处理工具交互，以便它能按需获取新信息。
Langchain helps manage state so the application remembers what's happened, memory so it can recall relevant past interactions,
and tool interactions so it can pull in new information as needed.

802
01:43:51,726 --> 01:43:54,372
这样回复就能保持相关且与时俱进。
The responses stay relevant and up to date.

803
01:43:54,926 --> 01:44:00,612
最常见的应用场景之一是检索增强生成，也就是 RAG。
One of the most common use cases, retrieval augmented generation, or RAG.

804
01:44:01,198 --> 01:44:14,276
Langchain 为检索器提供了预构建的抽象模型，用于查找相关文档，
提供了处理不同文件格式的文档加载器，以及整合检索信息的提示词组合。
Langchain provides pre-built abstractions for retrievers that find relevant documents,
document loaders that process different file formats, and prompt composition that incorporates retrieved information.

805
01:44:14,958 --> 01:44:26,884
这让构建 Gen AI 系统变得容易得多，系统可以在生成回复前获取相关数据，
从而大幅提高事实准确性并减少幻觉。
This makes it much easier to build Gen AI systems that fetch relevant data before generating responses,
dramatically improving factual accuracy and reducing hallucinations.

806
01:44:27,726 --> 01:44:31,140
Langchain 也是基于智能体的系统的核心。
Langchain is also central to agent-based systems.

807
01:44:31,822 --> 01:44:39,204
这些是自主 AI 智能体，它们可以规划多步骤任务，并使用各种工具执行行动。
These are autonomous AI agents that can plan multi-step tasks, executing actions using various tools.

808
01:44:39,886 --> 01:44:45,060
它们会观察这些行动的结果，并根据所学到的内容调整下一步。
They observe the results of those actions and adapt their next step based on what they learned.

809
01:44:45,742 --> 01:45:00,772
这是数据库智能体、能够跨多个来源调查主题的研究智能体，
以及能够处理端到端工作流的任务自动化智能体的基础。
This is the foundation for database agents that can answer complex analytical questions,
research agents that can investigate topics across multiple sources, and task automation agents that can handle end-to-end workflows.

810
01:45:01,454 --> 01:45:07,024
最后，Langchain 支持 Enterprise 和特定领域的 Gen AI 解决方案。
Finally, Langchain supports enterprise and domain-specific Gen AI solutions.

811
01:45:07,214 --> 01:45:14,404
它支持与您现有的数据库、内部 APIs 以及身份验证服务进行集成。
It enables integration with your existing databases, your internal APIs, your authentication services.

812
01:45:14,990 --> 01:45:25,508
这使得 Gen AI 应用能够在遵循您的治理政策、安全要求和安全约束的同时，
在真实的 Business 环境中运行。
This allows Gen AI applications to operate within real business environments while following your governance policies,
security requirements, and safety constraints.

813
01:45:26,126 --> 01:45:29,796
这不仅仅是一个演示，而是你可以实际部署的东西。
It's not just a demo, it's something you can actually deploy.

814
01:45:30,190 --> 01:45:43,108
这些应用场景共同展示了 Langchain 如何将 Gen AI 从孤立的、
一次性的模型调用转变为解决现实问题的结构化、可靠的生产环境应用。
Together, these use cases show how Langchain turns Gen AI from isolated, one off model calls into structured, reliable,
production ready applications that solve real world problems.

815
01:45:43,534 --> 01:45:46,564
Langchain 和 Genai 正在快速演变。
Langchain and Genai are evolving rapidly.

816
01:45:47,118 --> 01:45:50,916
让我们来看看塑造它们用途的趋势以及它们的未来走向。
Let's explore the trends shaping their use and where they are headed.

817
01:45:51,854 --> 01:45:54,820
首先，Enterprise 采用率正在增加。
First, enterprise adoption is increasing.

818
01:45:55,278 --> 01:46:06,308
各行各业的公司正超越实验阶段，将 Langchain 集成到
生产级应用中，重点关注可靠性、安全性和可扩展性。
Companies across industries are moving beyond experiments and integrating Langchain into production grade applications,
focusing on reliability, security, and scale.

819
01:46:07,150 --> 01:46:10,372
其次，实时数据处理正在兴起。
Second, real-time data processing is on the rise.

820
01:46:10,830 --> 01:46:18,308
Gen AI 应用正通过从 APIs 和数据库获取实时数据，变得更具上下文感知能力。
Gen AI applications are becoming more context aware by pulling live data from APIs and databases.

821
01:46:18,926 --> 01:46:27,972
LangChain 通过 APIs 和数据库支持实时上下文，而事件流集成则取决于您的基础设施和工具。
LangChain supports real-time context via APIs and databases, while
event stream integration depends on your infrastructure and tooling.

822
01:46:28,942 --> 01:46:31,908
第三，基于智能体的架构正在增长。
Third, agent-based architectures are growing.

823
01:46:32,334 --> 01:46:38,916
团队正在部署能够规划任务并执行多步骤工作流的自主 AI 智能体。
Teams are deploying autonomous AI agents that can plan tasks and execute multi-step workflows.

824
01:46:39,566 --> 01:46:45,060
Langchain 支持这个，但建议使用 Langgraph 来实现更可控的智能体工作流。
Langchain supports this, with Langgraph recommended for more controllable agent workflows.

825
01:46:45,742 --> 01:46:49,764
第四，检索增强生成，也就是 RAG。
Fourth, retrieval augmented generation, or RAG.

826
01:46:50,062 --> 01:46:51,556
它正在成为一种标准。
It is becoming a standard.

827
01:46:51,918 --> 01:46:57,808
现在许多 Gen AI 系统在生成回答之前，会自动检索相关的文档。
Many Gen AI systems now automatically retrieve relevant documents before generating responses.

828
01:46:58,158 --> 01:47:04,964
LangChain 通过内置的检索器和编排简化了这一过程，提高了准确性和可信度。
LangChain simplifies this through built-in retrievers and orchestrations, improving accuracy and trust.

829
01:47:05,262 --> 01:47:08,388
现在，让我们讨论一些关键的技术创新。
Now, let's discuss some key technical innovations.

830
01:47:09,006 --> 01:47:12,676
首先，多模态集成正变得越来越普遍。
First, multimodal integration is becoming more common.

831
01:47:13,230 --> 01:47:18,372
这意味着在统一的工作流中结合文本、图像和结构化数据。
This means combining text, images, and structured data in unified workflows.

832
01:47:19,182 --> 01:47:26,768
Langchain 让编排这些多样化的输入变得非常简单，让应用能够同时处理和分析它们。
Langchain makes it easy to orchestrate these diverse inputs, enabling applications to process and analyze them together.

833
01:47:27,086 --> 01:47:33,476
第二，随着应用从原型走向生产环境，生产环境的可扩展性变得至关重要。
Second, as applications move from prototypes to production, production scalability becomes crucial.

834
01:47:34,062 --> 01:47:46,768
Langchain 支持高级日志、可观测性和治理框架，确保您的系统稳健、可扩展，
并且能在适当的监控和控制下处理企业级需求。
Langchain supports advanced logging, observability, and governance frameworks, ensuring that your systems are robust, scalable,
and can handle enterprise-level demands with proper monitoring and control.

835
01:47:47,310 --> 01:47:51,012
最后，Langchain 拥有不断增长的开源生态系统。
Finally, Langchain has a growing open source ecosystem.

836
01:47:51,438 --> 01:48:03,588
这包括来自社区的贡献、预构建的组件以及用于常见任务的可重用链，
从而加速开发并降低构建高级 Gen AI 应用的门槛。
This includes contributions from the community, pre-built components, and reusable chains for common tasks,
accelerating development and lowering the barrier for building advanced gen AI applications.

837
01:48:03,968 --> 01:48:08,132
现在，让我们谈谈伴随这些进步而来的伦理考量。
Now, let's talk about the ethical considerations that come with these advancements.

838
01:48:08,686 --> 01:48:11,780
首先，负责任的 AI 是一个重点。
First, responsible AI is a major focus.

839
01:48:12,334 --> 01:48:25,316
基于决策的系统配备了护栏、持续监控和人类监督机制，以
确保它们在处理敏感或高风险任务时能够安全且公平地运行。
Decision-based systems are built with guardrails, continuous monitoring, and human oversight mechanisms to ensure they operate safely
and fairly, particularly when dealing with sensitive or high-stakes tasks.

840
01:48:25,710 --> 01:48:28,848
第二，透明度对 AI 系统至关重要。
Second, transparency is essential for AI systems.

841
01:48:29,198 --> 01:48:40,448
Langchain 强调可解释决策并提供审计追踪，这意味着
AI 做出的决策是可以被追踪和理解的，从而确保问责制。
Langchain emphasizes explainable decision making and provides audit trails, which
means decisions made by the AI can be traced and understood, ensuring accountability.

842
01:48:40,782 --> 01:48:55,488
就像我们在上一页看到的，围绕 Langchain 的开源生态系统在不断增长，
允许社区贡献和预构建的组件，让构建可扩展且负责任的 AI 系统变得更容易。
And just like we saw in the previous slide, the open source ecosystem around Langchain continues to grow,
allowing for community contributions and pre-built components that make it easier to build a scaled, responsible AI system.

843
01:48:55,982 --> 01:48:58,980
在结束之前，让我们谈谈一个常见问题。
Before we wrap up, let's talk about a common question.

844
01:48:59,374 --> 01:49:00,128
哪些是免费的？
What's free?

845
01:49:00,462 --> 01:49:01,476
哪些是收费的？
What costs money?

846
01:49:01,774 --> 01:49:05,028
以及在 Langchain 生态系统中，每种情况什么时候才合理？
And when does each make sense in the Langchain ecosystem?

847
01:49:05,710 --> 01:49:10,532
从免费工具和资源开始，Langchain 完全是开源的。
Starting with the free tools and resources, Langchain is completely open source.

848
01:49:11,310 --> 01:49:18,052
核心库，包括 Langchain Core、Langchain Community 和 Langgraph，都是免费提供的。
The core libraries, Langchain Core, Langchain Community, and Langgraph are all available at no cost.

849
01:49:18,926 --> 01:49:24,676
有了这些，您可以在不支付框架本身的费用的情况下构建复杂的 Gen AI 应用。
With these, you can build sophisticated Gen AI applications without paying for the framework itself.

850
01:49:25,454 --> 01:49:38,276
这些免费工具包括核心功能，如与多个供应商的 LLM 集成、基础 API 连接，以及构建链、
智能体和任务自动化工作流的能力。
These free tools include essential features like LLM integrations with multiple providers, basic API connections,
and capabilities for building chains, agents, and task automation workflows.

851
01:49:39,054 --> 01:49:49,252
核心编排是免费且开源的，但生产级别的可观测性、
评估和部署通常通过 Langsmith 或其他工具来处理。
Core orchestration is free and open source, but production level observability, evaluations,
and deployment are typically handled via Langsmith or other tools.

852
01:49:49,934 --> 01:49:55,940
Langchain 还可以与 Llama、Mistral 等开源模型无缝集成。
Langchain also integrates seamlessly with open source models like Llama, Mistral, and others.

853
01:49:56,590 --> 01:50:02,212
这让您可以在不依赖付费模型供应商的情况下进行实验并构建生产系统。
This allows you to experiment and build production systems without relying on paid model providers.

854
01:50:03,022 --> 01:50:12,752
免费生态系统非常适合学习 Gen AI 的开发者、学生、小型团队，
以及任何想要完全掌控且不想被供应商锁定的用户。
The free ecosystem is perfect for developers learning Gen AI, students, small teams,
and anyone wanting full control without vendor lock-in.

855
01:50:13,422 --> 01:50:17,312
由你来管理部署、基础设施和架构决策。
You manage deployment, infrastructure, and architecture decisions.

856
01:50:17,486 --> 01:50:25,860
当付费工具变得相关时，它们通常在两个领域发挥作用：模型访问和平台基础设施。
When paid tools become relevant, paid tools usually come into play in two areas, model access and platform infrastructure.

857
01:50:26,446 --> 01:50:35,396
对于模型，付费服务通常提供对 GPT-4、Claude
Opus 等高级模型的访问，具体取决于供应商和方案。
For models, paid services often provide access to premium models like GPT-4, Claude Opus, depending on the provider and plan.

858
01:50:35,918 --> 01:50:44,004
这些服务可能提供更高的速率限制、服务等级协议，以及用于
生产环境工作负载的可靠性和性能方面的 Enterprise 级控制。
These may offer higher rate limits, SLAs, and enterprise level controls for reliability and performance in production workloads.

859
01:50:44,686 --> 01:50:57,124
平台基础设施通常包括可扩展性、负载均衡、故障转移机制和保证的可用性，
这对于处理大量请求的生产系统非常重要。
Platform infrastructure typically includes scalability, load balancing, failover mechanisms, and guaranteed uptime,
important for production systems that handle large volumes of requests.

860
01:50:57,934 --> 01:51:03,876
然而，这些并不是由 Langsmith 管理的，Langsmith 主要专注于可观测性和部署。
However, this is not managed by Langsmith, which focuses on observability and deployment.

861
01:51:04,270 --> 01:51:06,711
安全性是另一个重要因素。
Security is another important factor.

862
01:51:07,246 --> 01:51:14,820
付费工具通常配备增强的安全功能，并拥有医疗和金融等行业的合规性认证。
Paid tools often come with enhanced security features and compliance certifications for industries like healthcare and finance.

863
01:51:15,726 --> 01:51:18,592
在处理敏感数据时，这些变得至关重要。
These become critical when handling sensitive data.

864
01:51:18,926 --> 01:51:29,092
保证性的平台还提供优先支持，包括保证的响应时间、专门的技术协助和更快的故障解决。
Guaranteed platforms also offer priority support, including guaranteed
response times, dedicated technical assistance, and faster issue resolution.

865
01:51:29,774 --> 01:51:36,036
确保生产系统平稳运行，所以让我们讨论一下什么时候该用免费工具，什么时候该用付费工具。
Ensuring production systems run smoothly, so let's discuss when to use free versus paid tools.

866
01:51:36,558 --> 01:51:41,540
免费工具非常适合学习、早期开发和实验。
Free tools are excellent for learning, early stage development, and experimentation.

867
01:51:42,158 --> 01:51:45,872
当你拥有足够的灵活性自己排查问题时，它们非常棒。
They are great when you have the flexibility to troubleshoot issues yourself.

868
01:51:46,126 --> 01:51:55,204
当你需要保证的可扩展性、安全性、合规性或支持以
满足截止日期和服务等级协议时，付费工具是必要的。
Paid tools are necessary when you need guaranteed scalability, security, compliance, or support to meet deadlines and SLAs.

869
01:51:55,918 --> 01:52:01,380
当你部署企业赖以生存的关键任务应用时，它们也是必不可少的。
They are also essential when deploying mission-critical applications that your business depends on.

870
01:52:02,062 --> 01:52:13,892
Langchain 架构的优点在于，你可以从免费工具开始，构建并验证你的应用，
然后仅在付费组件提供明确价值时才添加它们。
The great thing about Langchain's architecture is that you can start with the free tools, build and validate your application,
and then add paid components only when they provide clear value.

871
01:52:14,414 --> 01:52:17,472
你不需要被迫做出全有或全无的决定。
You are not locked into an all-or-nothing decision.

872
01:52:17,632 --> 01:52:26,340
在本模块中，我们将设置好所有必要的内容，在 Google Colab
中使用 Azure OpenAI 并结合 Langchain 来构建 AI 应用。
In this module, we'll set up everything you need to start building AI applications using Langchain in Google Colab with Azure OpenAI.

873
01:52:26,926 --> 01:52:33,572
Langchain 是一个 Python 框架，用于以结构化的方式与大语言模型或 LLMs 进行交互。
Langchain is a Python framework used to work with large language models or LLMs in a structured way.

874
01:52:34,254 --> 01:52:40,388
这使得连接模型、创建链以及构建应用变得更简单且更模块化。
This makes connecting to models, creating chains, and building applications easier and more modular.

875
01:52:40,910 --> 01:52:46,372
Google Colab 是一个免费的基于云的 Python 笔记本环境，可以在你的浏览器中运行。
Google Colab is a free cloud-based Python notebook environment that runs in your browser.

876
01:52:46,926 --> 01:52:53,348
你不需要在本地机器上安装 Python、设置开发环境或配置硬件。
You don't need to install Python, set up a development environment, or configure hardware on your local machine.

877
01:52:53,774 --> 01:53:02,116
Colab 提供了一个 Jupyter 风格的笔记本界面，你可以在其中编写代码，立即看到结果，
并将你的工作保存到 Google Drive。
Colab provides a Jupyter-style notebook interface where you can write
code, see results immediately, and save your work to Google Drive.

878
01:53:02,510 --> 01:53:04,836
运行 LLMs 主要有两种方式。
There are two main ways to run LLMs.

879
01:53:05,152 --> 01:53:20,228
第一种是托管 API 模型，如 Azure OpenAI、OpenAI、Anthropic；第二种是本地或自托管模型，
如 Olama、LM Studio 或你自己的接口服务器。
First is hosted API models like Azure OpenAI, OpenAI, Anthropic, and second is
local or self-hosted models like Olama, LM Studio, or your own interface server.

880
01:53:20,814 --> 01:53:26,340
基于云的模型对初学者来说更容易，因为你不需要特殊的硬件或下载模型。
Cloud based models are easier for beginners because you don't need special hardware or model downloads.

881
01:53:27,022 --> 01:53:34,308
它们可以在任何有互联网连接的机器上运行，并反映了生产系统中使用的真实 API 工作流。
They work on any machine with internet access and reflect the real world API based workflows used in production systems.

882
