在这里，messages 键将包含用户和智能体之间交换的消息列表。
Here, the key messages will hold a list of messages exchanged between the user and the agent.

1933
03:46:09,070 --> 03:46:15,856
通过使用 Annotated 和 add_messages，我们将确保消息符合预期的格式。
By using annotated and add underscore messages, we'll ensure that the messages adhere to the expected format.

1934
03:46:16,016 --> 03:46:21,188
这种结构化的方法允许我们的智能体有效地跟踪对话上下文。
This structured approach allows our agent to keep track of the conversation context effectively.

1935
03:46:21,582 --> 03:46:25,056
接下来，我们将使用 ChatGrok 初始化我们的语言模型。
Next, we'll initialize our language model using Chat GROK.

1936
03:46:25,518 --> 03:46:32,196
我们指定想要使用的模型，在这种情况下是 Llama 3.170B versatile。
We specify the model we want to use, which in this case is Llama 3.170B versatile.

1937
03:46:32,846 --> 03:46:38,628
这是 Grok 提供的一个免费模型，它能提供强大的语言生成能力。
This is a free model offered by Grok that provides us with powerful language generation capabilities.

1938
03:46:39,118 --> 03:46:43,108
温度参数控制模型输出的随机性。
The temperature parameter controls the randomness over the model's output.

1939
03:46:43,854 --> 03:46:52,260
将其设置为零意味着我们选择确定性响应，确保我们的智能体对相同的输入产生一致的回复。
Setting it to zero means we are opting for deterministic responses,
ensuring that our agents will produce consistent replies to the same input.

1940
03:46:52,846 --> 03:46:56,900
现在让我们通过初始化 Tavli 搜索结果来配置搜索工具。
Now let's configure the search tool by initializing Tabley search results.

1941
03:46:57,614 --> 03:47:03,172
这个工具将使我们的智能体在需要额外信息时能够进行网络搜索。
This tool will enable our agent to perform web searches when it requires additional information.

1942
03:47:03,950 --> 03:47:11,524
我们将最大结果参数设置为两个，这意味着智能体在进行网络搜索时将获取最多两个搜索结果。
We set the max results parameter to two, which means the agent will retrieve up to two search results when performing a web search.

1943
03:47:12,206 --> 03:47:18,052
这将允许它向用户提供简洁且相关的信息，而不会让他们感到信息过载。
This will allow it to present concise and relevant information to the user without overwhelming them.

1944
03:47:18,670 --> 03:47:21,636
然后我们将搜索工具绑定到我们的语言模型上。
And then we'll bind the search tool to our language model.

1945
03:47:22,062 --> 03:47:27,460
这一步至关重要，因为它允许语言模型在操作过程中访问搜索工具。
This step is crucial as it allows the language model to access the search tool during its operations.

1946
03:47:28,110 --> 03:47:39,332
通过这样做，语言模型现在可以在需要获取实时信息时利用 Tavli 搜索结果工具，
将生成的响应与来自网络的当前数据相结合。
By doing this, a language model can now utilize the Tavli search results tool whenever it needs to fetch real-time information,
blending generated responses with current data from the web.

1947
03:47:39,918 --> 03:47:45,380
在下一步中，我们将定义智能体节点，这是我们 AI 智能体的核心功能。
In the next step, we'll define the agent node, which is a core functionality of our AI agent.

1948
03:47:45,966 --> 03:47:49,668
这个函数将决定智能体如何响应用户输入。
This function will determine how the agent responds to user inputs.

1949
03:47:50,318 --> 03:47:52,096
让我们仔细看看代码。
Let's take a closer look at the code.

1950
03:47:52,256 --> 03:47:57,092
我们首先定义一个名为 智能体 的函数，它接受 state 作为参数。
We'll begin by defining a function named agent, which takes state as an argument.

1951
03:47:57,902 --> 03:48:04,484
state 参数代表我们当前的对话状态，包含与用户交换的消息。
The state parameter represents our current conversation status and contains the messages exchanged with the user.

1952
03:48:05,678 --> 03:48:08,708
这个函数的目的简单但至关重要。
The purpose of this function is simple but crucial.

1953
03:48:09,166 --> 03:48:17,604
智能体需要决定是直接回复生成的消息，还是利用其搜索工具之一来获取额外信息。
The agent needs to decide whether to respond with a generated message
or utilize one of its search tools to fetch additional information.

1954
03:48:18,094 --> 03:48:22,916
在我们的实现中，我们依赖之前绑定的语言模型和工具。
In our implementation, we rely on the previously bound language model and tools.

1955
03:48:23,662 --> 03:48:29,060
在下一行，我们调用之前初始化并绑定到 Tool 上的语言模型。
In the next line, we make a call to the language model we have initialized and bound to our tools.

1956
03:48:29,998 --> 03:48:37,412
这里我们使用 LLM 配合 ToolsInvoke，将来自 state 的消息列表传递给语言模型。
Here we use LLM with ToolsInvoke to pass the list of messages from the state into the language model.

1957
03:48:38,158 --> 03:48:44,976
invoke 方法处理这些消息，并根据对话历史生成连贯的响应。
The invoke method processes those messages and generates a coherent response based on the conversation history.

1958
03:48:45,326 --> 03:48:50,820
所以基本上，智能体 函数充当我们 AI 智能体的决策组件。
So basically, the agent function acts as the decision-making component of our AI agent.

1959
03:48:51,374 --> 03:48:58,404
它通过语言模型处理用户消息，并准备好随后发送给用户的响应。
It processes user messages through the language model and prepares a response which will then be sent back to the user.

1960
03:48:58,862 --> 03:49:01,668
我们将定义我们 AI 智能体的工具节点。
We will define the tool node of our AI agent.

1961
03:49:02,222 --> 03:49:09,508
这个组件负责根据智能体的决策执行任何需要外部工具的任务。
This component is responsible for executing any tasks that require external tools based on the agent's decision.

1962
03:49:10,062 --> 03:49:11,844
让我们仔细看看代码。
Let's take a closer look at the code.

1963
03:49:12,174 --> 03:49:17,412
我们首先定义一个名为 toolNode 的函数，它接受 state 作为参数。
We start by defining a function called toolNode, which takes state as its argument.

1964
03:49:17,902 --> 03:49:25,936
就像 智能体 函数一样，这个 state 参数包含对话历史，允许我们检索必要的消息。
Just like the agent function, this state parameter contains the conversation history and allows us to retrieve the necessary messages.

1965
03:49:26,158 --> 03:49:31,748
这个函数的主要目的是执行智能体决定要进行的任何工具调用。
The main purpose of this function is to execute any tool calls that the agent has decided to make.

1966
03:49:32,654 --> 03:49:36,676
我们首先从对话历史中提取最后一条消息。
We begin by extracting the last message from the conversation history.

1967
03:49:37,422 --> 03:49:41,444
接下来，我们使用 toolcalls 在最后一条消息中查找工具调用。
Next, we look for tool calls in the last message using toolcalls.

1968
03:49:42,222 --> 03:49:45,892
这个变量存储了所有已执行的工具调用列表。
This variable stores a list of all the tool calls that were made.

1969
03:49:46,702 --> 03:49:50,820
我们还会准备一个名为 results 的空列表来存储输出。
We'll also prepare an empty list named results to store our output.

1970
03:49:51,438 --> 03:49:53,956
现在我们将遍历每一个工具调用。
Now we'll iterate through each tool call.

1971
03:49:54,318 --> 03:49:58,980
对于每一次调用，我们调用搜索工具并传递所需的参数。
For every call, we invoke the search tool and pass the required arguments.

1972
03:49:59,790 --> 03:50:06,244
invoke 方法会执行工具并返回结果，然后我们将结果添加到 results 列表中。
The invoke method executes the tool and returns the result, which we then append to our results list.

1973
03:50:07,214 --> 03:50:15,396
每条记录都包含角色 tool、来自工具结果的内容，以及用于追踪的工具调用 ID。
Each entry includes the role tool, the content from the tool result, and the ID of the tool call for tracking purpose.

1974
03:50:16,078 --> 03:50:19,972
然后我们将结果包装成字典格式返回。
And then we return the results wrapped in a dictionary format.

1975
03:50:21,070 --> 03:50:29,444
在下一步中，我们将定义条件逻辑，以确定智能体是继续使用工具还是结束对话。
In the next step, we'll define the conditional logic that determines
whether the agent should continue using tools or end the conversation.

1976
03:50:30,158 --> 03:50:39,396
Should continue 函数的作用是分析最后一条消息，并决定是跳转到工具节点还是结束对话。
Should continue functions purpose is to analyze the last message and
decide if we should transition to the tool node or end the conversation.

1977
03:50:40,206 --> 03:50:46,276
然后我们使用 has_tool_calls 来检查最后一条消息中是否存在工具调用。
We then use has underscore added to check for the presence of tool calls in the last message.

1978
03:50:47,022 --> 03:50:50,852
如果有工具调用，我们将继续前往工具节点。
If there are tool calls made, we'll continue to the tool node.

1979
03:50:51,342 --> 03:50:57,828
如果没有工具调用，我们只需返回 end，表示工作流应该结束。
If no tool calls are present, we'll simply return end, signaling that the workflow should conclude.

1980
03:50:58,670 --> 03:51:05,668
有了这些组件，我们的 AI 智能体现在已经具备了动态处理用户请求的能力。
With these components in place, our AI agent is now well equipped to process user requests dynamically.

1981
03:51:06,286 --> 03:51:11,280
在下一步中，我们将通过构建状态图来构建 AI 智能体的流程。
In our next step, we'll construct the flow of our AI agent by building the graph.

1982
03:51:11,440 --> 03:51:17,316
这个状态图将定义我们的智能体如何与用户交互，以及如何根据对话做出决策。
This graph will define how our agent interacts with users and makes decisions based on the conversations.

1983
03:51:17,998 --> 03:51:20,004
让我们分解一下代码的每个部分。
Let's break down each part of the code.

1984
03:51:20,430 --> 03:51:25,508
我们首先创建一个 状态图 实例，并传入我们之前定义的 state。
We start by creating an instance of state graph, passing in the state we defined earlier.

1985
03:51:26,126 --> 03:51:29,924
这个实例将作为我们智能体工作流的基础。
This instance will serve as the foundation for our agent's workflow.

1986
03:51:30,350 --> 03:51:32,324
接下来，我们向状态图中添加节点。
Next, we'll add nodes to our graph.

1987
03:51:32,878 --> 03:51:36,388
每个节点代表我们智能体中的特定功能。
Each node represents a specific functionality with our agent.

1988
03:51:36,814 --> 03:51:42,628
在这种情况下，我们添加了两个节点，一个是智能体节点，另一个是用于调用工具的节点。
In this case, we are adding two nodes, one of the agent and another for invoking the tool node.

1989
03:51:43,310 --> 03:51:49,604
第一个节点标记为 智能体，链接到我们的 智能体 函数，该函数负责处理用户消息。
The first node, labeled agent, links to our agent function, which processes user messages.

1990
03:51:50,478 --> 03:51:57,316
第二个节点标记为 Tools，连接到我们的 ToolNode 函数，该函数负责处理工具执行。
The second node, labeled Tools, connects to our ToolNode function, which handles tool executions.

1991
03:51:58,222 --> 03:52:04,676
现在我们需要定义这些节点如何连接，我们通过向状态图添加边来实现这一点。
Now we need to define how these nodes are connected, which we accomplish by adding edges to the graph.

1992
03:52:05,646 --> 03:52:10,148
我们从一条连接起始点到智能体节点的边开始构建状态图。
We start the graph with an edge that connects the start point to the agent node.

1993
03:52:10,862 --> 03:52:18,084
这意味着当对话开始时，它会立即在智能体节点处理任何用户输入。
This means when the conversation begins, it will immediately process any user input at the agent's node.

1994
03:52:18,990 --> 03:52:22,340
然后我们从智能体节点建立条件边。
We then establish conditional edges from the agent node.

1995
03:52:22,990 --> 03:52:30,020
这允许我们的智能体根据 Should continue 函数中的决策过程来确定下一步。
This allows our agent to determine its next step based on the decision process in the Should continue function.

1996
03:52:30,926 --> 03:52:36,068
最后，我们创建一个从 Tools 节点循环回智能体节点的边。
Finally, we create an edge that loops back from the Tools node to the agent node.

1997
03:52:36,750 --> 03:52:45,764
这能确保智能体在执行任何工具行动后，仍能再次做出回应，从而与用户保持持续对话。
This ensures that after executing any tool actions, the agent can respond again, maintaining a continuous dialogue with the user.

1998
03:52:46,318 --> 03:52:52,960
既然我们已经构建了整个图结构，现在是时候把它编译成可执行的应用程序了。
Now that we have built our entire graph structure, it's time to compile it into an executable application.

1999
03:52:53,294 --> 03:53:00,228
通过调用 工作流编译，我们将定义的图转换成可以执行的应用程序。
By calling workflow.compile, we transform our defined graph into an application that can be executed.

2000
03:53:00,942 --> 03:53:08,516
这个编译后的应用程序集成了我们定义的所有节点和边，让智能体能够有效运行。
This compiled application integrates all the nodes and edges we have defined, allowing the agent to function effectively.

2001
03:53:09,486 --> 03:53:15,812
run_智能体 函数作为用户与我们的 AI 智能体交互的接口。
The run underscore agent function serves as the interface for users to interact with our AI agent.

2002
03:53:16,558 --> 03:53:22,916
它负责获取用户输入，调用智能体获取响应，并清晰地展示结果。
It captures user input, invokes the agent to get a response, and displays the results clearly.

2003
03:53:23,566 --> 03:53:33,092
函数里的第一步是打印一个分隔符，为了清晰起见，方便区分输出中的用户输入和响应。
The first thing we do inside the function is to print a separator for clarity,
making it easier to differentiate between user input and responses in our output.

2004
03:53:33,998 --> 03:53:40,100
接下来，我们将用户的输入传递给编译好的应用程序，以获取智能体的响应。
Next, we pass user's input to our compiled application to get a response from the agent.

2005
03:53:40,878 --> 03:53:47,460
我们使用 app 对象的 invoke 方法，并提供符合预期格式的消息。
We use the invoke method of our app object, providing it with a message structured in the expected format.

2006
03:53:48,302 --> 03:53:53,988
在这里，消息包含角色为 user，内容是用户的实际输入。
Here, the message contains the role user and the user's actual input as the content.

2007
03:53:54,958 --> 03:53:59,152
调用智能体后，我们需要从结果中提取响应。
After invoking the agent, we need to extract the response from the result.

2008
03:53:59,822 --> 03:54:06,596
我们访问结果消息中的最后一项，并将其内容存储在变量 Final Response 中。
We access the last entry in the results messages and store its content in the variable Final Response.

2009
03:54:07,374 --> 03:54:10,084
这个内容将包含智能体的回复。
This content will contain the agent's reply.

2010
03:54:10,830 --> 03:54:16,132
为了完成交互，我们再次打印智能体的响应，并进行格式化处理以确保清晰。
To complete the interaction, we print the agent's response again with formatting for clarity.

2011
03:54:16,750 --> 03:54:22,244
在最后一步中，我们将通过运行一个特定的查询来模拟与智能体的交互。
In this final step, we'll simulate interaction with our agent by running a specific query.

2012
03:54:22,894 --> 03:54:26,308
这将展示整个设置在实践中是如何运作的。
This will illustrate how the entire setup works in practice.

2013
03:54:26,990 --> 03:54:31,392
在这个例子中，我们问智能体：AI 最新的进展是什么？
In this example, we ask the agent what are the latest developments in AI?

2014
03:54:31,632 --> 03:54:41,252
这个问题特别有意思，因为它要求智能体利用其网络搜索能力，提供准确且最新的回答。
This question is particularly interesting because it requires the agent to utilize
its web search capabilities to provide an informed and up-to-date response.

2015
03:54:41,998 --> 03:54:50,884
现在你已经看到如何使用 LangGraph，结合工具集成、
状态管理和动态工作流来构建一个完整的 AI 智能体。
Now you have seen how to build a complete AI agent using Langgraph with tool integration, state management, and dynamic workflows.

2016
03:54:51,342 --> 03:55:02,308
去了解智能体如何感知输入、决定是直接回答还是调
用工具、相应地执行任务，并跨步骤保持对话上下文。
To learn how the agent perceives input, decides whether to respond or call
tools, executes tasks accordingly, and keeps conversation context across steps.

2017
03:55:02,830 --> 03:55:11,524
有了这个基础，你的智能体就准备好处理真实的用户
查询、提供最新的信息，并随着时间的推移不断适应。
With this foundation, your agent is ready to handle real user queries, provide up-to-date information, and adapt over time.

2018
03:55:12,430 --> 03:55:19,428
这个实操环节向你展示了如何结合强大的工具来创建智能的、以任务为导向的智能体。
This practical session shows you how to combine powerful tools to create intelligent, task-oriented agents.

2019
03:55:20,238 --> 03:55:30,788
我们将深入探讨如何利用一些优秀的现代工具，如 LangGraph 和 Grok API，
来构建一个强大的 AI 客户服务智能体。
We are going to dive deep into building a powerful AI customer support
agent using some fantastic modern tools like LangGraph and the Grok API.

2020
03:55:31,598 --> 03:55:33,444
让我们来看看问题陈述。
Let's move to the problem statement.

2021
03:55:34,062 --> 03:55:36,676
想象一家典型的电子商务公司。
Imagine a typical e-commerce company.

2022
03:55:37,198 --> 03:55:41,152
客户不断提出问题，比如：我的订单在哪里？
Customers constantly have questions like, where is my order?

2023
03:55:41,486 --> 03:55:45,732
或者：请告诉我关于产品 X 的信息，或者：我该如何退货？
Tell me about Product X, or, How do I return something?

2024
03:55:46,254 --> 03:55:48,548
这些都是常见且重复的查询。
These are common, repetitive queries.

2025
03:55:49,102 --> 03:55:52,036
虽然这些很重要，但它们可能会占用人工客服人员的时间。
While important, they can tie up human support agents.

2026
03:55:52,590 --> 03:56:04,132
我们的目标是自动化这些交互，让客户服务更快、更高效，
并且能够 24 小时全天候提供准确且有用的信息。
Our goal is to automate these interactions, making customer service faster, more efficient, and available 24 by 7,
while still providing accurate and helpful information.

2027
03:56:04,750 --> 03:56:07,108
我们这里将利用两个主要的框架。
We'll be leveraging two main frameworks here.

2028
03:56:07,534 --> 03:56:13,124
一个是 LangChain，这是一个专门为开发由大语言模型驱动的应用程序而设计的框架。
Langchain, which is a framework designed for developing applications powered by large language models.

2029
03:56:13,806 --> 03:56:17,392
我们将使用它的核心组件来定义工具和消息。
We'll use its core components for defining tools and messages.

2030
03:56:17,678 --> 03:56:20,388
然后是构建在 LangChain 之上的 LangGraph。
Then Langgraph, built on top of Langchain.

2031
03:56:21,166 --> 03:56:27,492
LangGraph 专门用于构建基于 LLMs 的健壮的、有状态的多智能体应用。
Langgraph is specifically for building robust, stateful, multi-actor applications with LLMs.

2032
03:56:28,302 --> 03:56:35,204
你可以把它想象成一种编排复杂行动和决策链的方法，非常类似于有限状态机。
Think of it as a way to orchestrate complex chains of actions and decisions, much like a finite state machine.

2033
03:56:35,982 --> 03:56:41,924
至于我们智能体的核心大脑，也就是大语言模型本身，我们使用的是 Grok API。
And for the brain of our agent, the large language model itself, we are using the Grok API.

2034
03:56:42,382 --> 03:56:51,152
现在，Grok 的一个绝佳之处在于它提供了极快的推理速度，通常比其他供应商快得多。
Now, a fantastic aspect of Grok is that it provides incredibly fast inference speeds, often much quicker than other providers.

2035
03:56:51,312 --> 03:57:02,212
此外，在录制时，Grok 为开发者提供非常丰厚的免费层级，
这使其成为开始尝试 LLM 驱动应用的完美且易于获取的选择。
Plus, at the time of recording, Grok offers a generous free tier for developers,
making it a perfect accessible choice for getting started with LLM-powered applications.

2036
03:57:02,606 --> 03:57:04,672
当然，你并不局限于 Grok。
Of course, you're not limited to Grok.

2037
03:57:05,232 --> 03:57:07,684
这个架构是非常灵活的。
This architecture is highly flexible.

2038
03:57:08,078 --> 03:57:21,508
你可以轻松地将 Grok LLM 替换为其他流行的供应商，比如 OpenAI 的 GPT 模型、
Anthropic 的 Cloud、Google 的 Gemini，甚至是你自己托管的各种开源模型。
You could easily swap out the Grok LLM for other popular providers like OpenAI's GPT models, Anthropic's Cloud, Google's Gemini,
or even various open source models that you might host yourself.

2039
03:57:21,870 --> 03:57:23,492
原理都是一样的。
The principles remain the same.

2040
03:57:23,950 --> 03:57:25,232
让我们来看看代码。
Let's walk through the code.

2041
03:57:25,550 --> 03:57:33,312
我为 Jupyter Notebook 环境准备了一个可执行脚本，所以你可以直接复制并运行整个单元格。
I have prepared a single executable script for a Jupyter Notebook environment, so you can copy and run this entire cell directly.

2042
03:57:33,582 --> 03:57:36,644
首先，我们需要基础库。
First things first, we need our foundational libraries.

2043
03:57:37,198 --> 03:57:49,636
目前的 PIP 安装命令会安装用于与 Grok API 交互的 LangchainGrok，
用于基础构建块的 Langchain Core，以及用于编排智能体工作流的 Langgraph。
The PIP install command currently installs LangchainGrok for interacting with the Grok API,
Langchain Core for the fundamental building blocks, and Langgraph for orchestrating our agent's workflows.

2044
03:57:50,158 --> 03:57:52,272
这些是我们应用程序的骨干。
These are the backbone of our application.

2045
03:57:52,512 --> 03:58:00,676
为了开始构建我们的 AI 客户支持智能体，我们首
先需要安装必要的软件包，然后导入必要的模块。
To begin building our AI customer support agent, we first need to
install the requisite packages and then import the necessary modules.

2046
03:58:01,262 --> 03:58:02,852
让我们从安装开始。
Let's start with the installation.

2047
03:58:03,438 --> 03:58:11,812
我们将使用 LangChain 和 LangGraph 库，它们提供了实现对话式 AI 技术所需的工具。
We'll be using the Langchain and Langgraph libraries, which provide the tools necessary for implementing conversational AI technology.

2048
03:58:12,206 --> 03:58:18,884
现在我们安装好了软件包，就可以开始导入必要的模块和组件来设置我们的项目了。
Now that we have our packages installed, we can proceed to import the necessary modules and components to set up our project.

2049
03:58:19,534 --> 03:58:21,892
让我们逐一分解每个导入项。
Let's break down each import one by one.

2050
03:58:22,350 --> 03:58:24,164
首先是 OS 库。
First is OS Library.

2051
03:58:24,622 --> 03:58:28,996
这个标准的 Python 库用于与操作系统交互。
This standard Python library is used for interacting with the operating system.

2052
03:58:29,742 --> 03:58:37,380
它允许我们管理环境变量和路径操作，这对于处理程序中的配置至关重要。
It allows us to manage environment variables and path operations, which are essential for handling configurations in our program.

2053
03:58:37,870 --> 03:58:40,420
TypeDict、Annotated 和 Sequence。
Type dict, annotated, and sequence.

2054
03:58:41,294 --> 03:58:43,588
这些是来自 typing 模块的工具。
These are utilities from the typing module.

2055
03:58:44,110 --> 03:58:48,100
TypeDict 允许我们创建具有特定结构的字典。
TypeDict allows us to create dictionaries with a specific structure.

2056
03:58:48,750 --> 03:58:58,384
Annotated 用于给类型提示添加元数据，而 Sequence
代表通用的序列类型，我们将用它来管理消息列表。
Annotated is useful for adding metadata to type hints, and sequence represents a generic sequence type,
which we will use to manage lists of messages.

2057
03:58:58,894 --> 03:59:05,124
SeekModule 提供了一系列对应 Python 对象基本操作的高效函数。
SeekModule provides a set of efficient functions corresponding to basic operations on Python objects.

2058
03:59:05,934 --> 03:59:12,196
我们可以用它在代码中定义自定义操作和比较，从而增强代码的灵活性。
We can use it to define custom operations and comparisons in our code, enhancing its flexibility.

2059
03:59:12,750 --> 03:59:17,412
BaseMessage、HumanMessage、AIMessage 和 SystemMessage。
BaseMessage, HumanMessage, AI message, and system message.

2060
03:59:17,998 --> 03:59:24,996
这些来自 Langchain Core 消息模块的类，对于管理我们对话中的消息类型至关重要。
These classes from the Langchain Core messages module are integral for managing messages type in our conversations.

2061
03:59:25,294 --> 03:59:38,084
BaseMessage 作为基础类，而 HumanMessage、AIMessage 和 SystemMessage 分别扩展它，
分别代表来自用户、AI 和系统提示词的消息。
BaseMessage serves as a foundational class, while human message, iMessage, and SystemMessage extend it to represent messages from
users, the AI and system prompts, respectively.

2062
03:59:38,702 --> 03:59:40,064
接下来是 Tool。
Next is Tool.

2063
03:59:40,686 --> 03:59:48,516
这个来自 Langchain Core Tools 模块的工具，允许我们定义可以作为工具供智能体使用的函数。
This utility from the Langchain Core Tools modules allows us to define functions that can be used by our agents as tools.

2064
03:59:48,878 --> 03:59:55,396
它简化了外部能力的集成，智能体可以在交互过程中利用这些能力。
It simplifies the integration of external capabilities, which the agent can utilize during interactions.

2065
03:59:55,950 --> 03:59:56,784
ChatGROK。
ChatGROK.

2066
03:59:57,422 --> 04:00:02,916
这个类可以访问 Grok API，从而利用强大的语言模型。
This class enables access to the GROK API for leveraging powerful language models.

2067
04:00:03,278 --> 04:00:08,784
它允许我们的智能体生成回复，并与用户进行有效的对话交互。
It allows our agent to generate responses and interact conversationally with users effectively.

2068
04:00:09,102 --> 04:00:10,660
StateGraph 和 END。
StateGraph and END.

2069
04:00:11,342 --> 04:00:16,932
这些来自 Langgraph 模块的类被用于构建我们 AI 智能体的逻辑流。
These classes from the Langgraph module are used to construct the logic flow of our AI agent.

2070
04:00:17,966 --> 04:00:26,852
StateGraph 创建一个代表交互流的有向图，而 END 表示图中工作流的结束。
StateGraph creates a directed graph that represents the interaction flow,
while END signifies the conclusion of a workflow within the graph.

2071
04:00:27,342 --> 04:00:28,132
ToolNode。
ToolNode.

2072
04:00:28,718 --> 04:00:39,172
这个预构建的组件允许我们在图中集成外部工具，
使智能体能够在配置的工作流中按需执行特定任务。
This pre-built component allows us to integrate external tools in our graph,
enabling the agent to perform specific tasks as needed within the configured workflow.

2073
04:00:39,534 --> 04:00:49,028
所有包安装完毕并导入了必要的模块后，我们现在
准备好进入构建 AI 客户支持智能体的后续阶段了。
With all packages installed and necessary modules imported, we are now prepared
to proceed to the next stages of building our AI customer support agent.

2074
04:00:49,390 --> 04:00:53,572
安装完成后，我们导入所有必要的类和函数。
After installing, we import all the necessary classes and functions.

2075
04:00:54,062 --> 04:01:02,660
你会注意到来自 Typing 的 TypeDict 和 Annotated，它们用
于在 Langgraph 中为我们的智能体定义清晰且健壮的状态。
You will notice Type Dict and Annotated from Typing, which are used
for defining a clear and robust state for our agent within Langgraph.

2076
04:01:03,278 --> 04:01:07,492
我们还导入了基础消息类型，用于处理对话轮次。
We also import base message types for handling conversational turns.

2077
04:01:08,046 --> 04:01:11,716
在我们的智能体能够回答问题之前，它需要一些信息。
Before our agent can answer questions, it needs some information.

2078
04:01:12,238 --> 04:01:17,584
这里我们设置了简单的 Python 字典，分别是 OrdersDB 和 ProductsDB。
Here we have set up simple Python dictionaries, OrdersDB and ProductsDB.

2079
04:01:17,744 --> 04:01:19,876
它们充当我们的模拟数据库。
These act as our mock databases.

2080
04:01:20,384 --> 04:01:28,996
OrdersDB 保存有关特定客户订单的信息，包括它们的订单状态、产品、追踪信息和送达日期。
OrdersDB holds information about specific customer orders, their status, product, tracking, and delivery dates.

2081
04:01:29,504 --> 04:01:37,700
ProductsDB 包含我们销售的产品详情，如名称、价格、库存情况和简短描述。
ProductsDB contains details about the products we sell, like name, price, availability, and brief descriptions.

2082
04:01:38,126 --> 04:01:43,876
在现实世界的场景中，这些将连接到向量数据库或外部 APIs。
In a real-world scenario, these would connect to vector databases or external APIs.

2083
04:01:44,366 --> 04:01:50,384
为了我们的演示，这些模拟数据库完全足够用来模拟真实数据的查询。
For our demonstration, these mock databases are perfectly fine for simulating real data lookup.

2084
04:01:50,798 --> 04:01:52,516
接下来是定义工具。
Next is defining tools.

2085
04:01:52,704 --> 04:01:56,004
这就是我们的智能体获得超能力的地方，也就是它的工具。
This is where our agent gains its superpowers, its tools.

2086
04:01:56,590 --> 04:02:02,788
我们定义了三个 Python 函数，每个函数都加上了来自 Langchain Core Tools 的工具装饰器。
We define three Python functions, each adorned with the tool decorator from Langchain Core Tools.

2087
04:02:03,502 --> 04:02:16,388
这个装饰器非常关键，因为它告诉 LLM 这些函数是可以被调用的，
而且它还会根据我们的函数文档字符串自动为 LLM 生成描述。
This decorator is crucial because it tells the LLM that these functions are available for it to call,
and it also automatically generates a description for the LLM based on our function DocString.

2088
04:02:16,878 --> 04:02:18,308
现在，是“查询订单”。
Now, Track Order.

2089
04:02:18,830 --> 04:02:21,764
这个 Tool 是为了查询订单状态而设计的。
This tool is designed to look up an order's status.

2090
04:02:22,190 --> 04:02:28,384
如果客户问：“我的订单 ID 为 ORD001 的包裹在哪里？”
If a customer asks, where is my package with order ID ORD001?

2091
04:02:28,942 --> 04:02:37,092
LLM 将识别出需要这个 Tool，提取出 ORD001，并将其传递给“查询订单”。
the LLM will identify the need for this tool, extract ORD001, and pass it to track order.

2092
04:02:37,582 --> 04:02:43,204
然后它会从我们的订单数据库中获取相关详情，并返回一个格式化好的字符串。
It then fetches the relevant details from our order's database and returns a formatted string.

2093
04:02:43,726 --> 04:02:50,788
同样，如果客户问：“给我讲讲这款笔记本电脑”，
我们的 LLM 将调用这个 Tool 并传入“笔记本电脑”。
Similarly, if a customer asks, tell me about the laptop, our LLM will invoke this tool with laptop.

2094
04:02:51,246 --> 04:02:58,436
接着它会查询我们的产品数据库，以获取并展示价格、库存情况和描述等详情。
It then queries our product's database to retrieve and present details like price, availability, and description.

2095
04:02:58,830 --> 04:02:59,940
“处理退货”。
Process return.

2096
04:03:00,398 --> 04:03:02,116
这是一个更复杂的 Tool。
This is a more complex tool.

2097
04:03:02,478 --> 04:03:05,984
它同时接收订单 ID 和退货原因。
It takes both an order ID and a reason for the return.

2098
04:03:06,286 --> 04:03:10,052
它会检查订单是否存在，以及是否符合退货条件。
It checks if the order exists and if it's eligible for return.

2099
04:03:10,702 --> 04:03:17,764
如果所有条件都满足，它会模拟处理退货，并提供退货 ID 和相关说明。
If all conditions are met, it simulates processing a return and provides a return ID and instructions.

2100
04:03:18,958 --> 04:03:23,204
最后，我们将所有这些 Tool 收集到一个名为 Tools 的列表中。
Finally, we gather all these tools into a list called Tools.

2101
04:03:23,950 --> 04:03:28,996
这个列表将交给我们的 LLM，让它知道自己拥有哪些能力。
This list will be given to our LLM so it knows the capabilities it possesses.

2102
04:03:30,126 --> 04:03:32,228
接下来是“获取产品信息”。
Next is Get Product Info.

2103
04:03:32,910 --> 04:03:40,996
在“获取产品信息”之后，如果客户问：“给我讲讲这款笔记本电脑”，
我们的 LLM 将调用这个 Tool 并传入“笔记本电脑”。
After Get Product Info, if a customer asks, Tell me about the laptop, our LLM will invoke this tool with laptop.

2104
04:03:41,200 --> 04:03:48,452
接着它会查询我们的产品数据库，以获取并展示价格、库存情况和描述等详情。
It then queries our products database to retrieve and present details like price, availability, and description.

2105
04:03:48,880 --> 04:03:50,020
“处理退货”。
Process Return.

2106
04:03:50,702 --> 04:03:52,484
这是一个更复杂的 Tool。
This is a more complex tool.

2107
04:03:52,910 --> 04:03:56,708
它同时接收订单 ID 和退货原因。
It takes both an order ID and a reason for the return.

2108
04:03:57,454 --> 04:04:01,060
它会检查订单是否存在，以及是否符合退货条件。
It checks if the order exists and if it's eligible for return.

2109
04:04:01,806 --> 04:04:08,452
如果所有条件都满足，它会模拟处理退货，并提供退货 ID 和相关说明。
If all conditions are met, it simulates processing a return and provides a return ID and instructions.

2110
04:04:08,878 --> 04:04:12,868
最后，我们将所有这些 Tool 收集到一个名为 Tools 的列表中。
Finally, we gather all these tools into a list called Tools.

2111
04:04:13,454 --> 04:04:18,212
这个列表将交给我们的 LLM，让它知道自己拥有的所有能力。
This list will be given to our LLM so it knows all the capabilities it possesses.

2112
04:04:18,574 --> 04:04:22,400
现在我们引入操作的核心大脑，也就是大语言模型。
Now we bring in the brain of our operation, the large language model.

2113
04:04:23,118 --> 04:04:30,080
我们实例化 ChatGrok，并将其指向 Llama 3.370P 这个多功能模型。
We instantiate ChatGroc, pointing it to the Llama 3.370P versatile model.

2114
04:04:30,862 --> 04:04:36,804
正如我提到的，Grok 的速度非常出色，而这个特定的模型是一个强力的选择。
As I mentioned, Grok is fantastic for its speed, and this particular model is a powerful choice.

2115
04:04:37,550 --> 04:04:39,588
我们将温度设置为零。
We set temperature equal to zero.

2116
04:04:40,078 --> 04:04:43,840
在 LLMs 中，温度控制输出的随机性。
In LLMs, temperature controls the randomness of the output.

2117
04:04:44,014 --> 04:04:53,668
温度设为零意味着 LLM 将尽可能保持确定性和事实性，这正是我们想要的客服智能体表现。
A temperature of zero means the LLM will try to be as deterministic and factual as possible,
which is exactly what we want for a customer support agent.

2118
04:04:54,318 --> 04:04:57,604
在提供订单详情时，我们不希望它发挥创意。
We don't want it to get creative when providing order details.

2119
04:04:58,414 --> 04:05:01,284
bind tools to LLM 这一行至关重要。
The line bind tools to LLM is crucial.

2120
04:05:01,838 --> 04:05:05,284
这一步是将我们自定义的 Python 工具绑定到 LLM 上。
This step binds our custom Python tools to the LLM.

2121
04:05:05,806 --> 04:05:12,836
它告诉 LLM，嘿，当用户提出的问题符合这些工具的用途时，你可以调用它们。
It tells the LLM, hey, when a user asks something that aligns with the purpose of these tools, you can call them.

2122
04:05:13,390 --> 04:05:21,732
这就是 LLM 变成智能编排者的方式，它决定是该查询订单还是仅仅生成文本回复。
This is how the LLM becomes an intelligent orchestrator, deciding when to use track order versus just generating a text response.

2123
04:05:21,934 --> 04:05:28,804
快速的 LLM invoke 调用只是一个健全性检查，确保我们与 Grok 的连接正常工作。
A quick LLM invoke call is just a sanity check to ensure our connection to Grok is working correctly.

2124
04:05:29,230 --> 04:05:31,300
接下来是定义智能体状态。
Next is defining agent state.

2125
04:05:31,886 --> 04:05:37,188
Langgraph 的运行基于状态的概念，这个状态在智能体的不同部分之间流动。
The Langgraph operates on the concept of a state that flows through the different parts of our agent.

2126
04:05:37,806 --> 04:05:41,540
我们使用名为 智能体状态 的类型 dict 来定义这个状态。
We define this state using a type dict called agent state.

2127
04:05:42,190 --> 04:05:42,948
消息。
Messages.

2128
04:05:43,374 --> 04:05:49,668
这是一个列表，将包含我们所有的对话历史，包括人类消息和 AIMessage。
This is a list that will hold our entire conversation history, including human message and iMessage.

2129
04:05:50,286 --> 04:05:56,100
基于序列的 Annotated 消息确保新消息只是简单地追加到序列中。
Annotated sequence-based message ensures that new messages are simply appended to the sequence.

2130
04:05:56,654 --> 04:05:58,212
然后，下一步。
Then, next step.

2131
04:05:58,542 --> 04:06:04,548
这是一个字符串，帮助我们的图在智能体做出决策后决定访问哪个节点。
This is a string that helps our graph decide which node to visit next after the agent has made a decision.

2132
04:06:04,942 --> 04:06:07,044
下一步是创建图节点。
Next step is creating graph nodes.

2133
04:06:07,598 --> 04:06:12,068
我们的智能体工作流在 LangGraph 框架中被分解为各个节点。
Our agent's workflow is broken down into nodes within the Lang Graph Framework.

2134
04:06:12,654 --> 04:06:16,164
每个节点代表一个独特的步骤或决策点。
Each node represents a distinct step or decision point.

2135
04:06:16,654 --> 04:06:18,628
这里你可以看到系统提示词。
Here you can see System Prompt.

2136
04:06:19,118 --> 04:06:20,644
这极其重要。
This is incredibly important.

2137
04:06:21,038 --> 04:06:25,540
它是每条用户消息之前提供给 LLM 的一组指令。
It is a set of instructions given to the LLM before every user message.

2138
04:06:25,838 --> 04:06:30,788
它定义了智能体的人格、能力和行为准则。
It defines the agent's persona, its capabilities, and its behavioral guidelines.

2139
04:06:31,566 --> 04:06:36,068
这个提示词引导 LLM 的思考，并确保它按预期行动。
This prompt guides the LLM's thinking and ensures it acts as desired.

2140
04:06:36,526 --> 04:06:37,476
调用智能体。
Call agent.

2141
04:06:37,870 --> 04:06:39,588
这是我们的核心思考节点。
This is our main thinking node.

2142
04:06:39,918 --> 04:06:47,588
它获取当前的智能体状态，将系统提示词预置到对话历史中，然后调用带有工具的 LLM。
It takes the current agent state, prepins the system prompt to the conversation history, and then calls our LLM with tools.

2143
04:06:48,206 --> 04:06:56,080
LLM 处理输入并决定是直接回复用户，还是需要调用我们定义的其中一个工具。
The LLM processes the input and decides should it directly respond to the user or does it need to call one of our defined tools.

2144
04:06:56,240 --> 04:07:06,244
如果 LLM 决定调用工具，响应的工具调用将包含工具调用详情，并且我们将下一步设为工具。
If the LLM decides to call a tool, response tool calls will contain the tool invocation details, and we set next step to tools.

2145
04:07:07,118 --> 04:07:13,856
如果 LLM 可以直接回复，它将不会包含工具调用，并且我们将下一步设为结束。
If the LLM can respond directly, it won't have tool calls, and we set next step to end.

2146
04:07:14,670 --> 04:07:15,460
工具节点。
Tool node.

2147
04:07:15,918 --> 04:07:19,012
这是一个方便的预构建图节点。
This is a convenient pre-built lane graph node.

2148
04:07:19,438 --> 04:07:24,996
它的唯一目的是执行调用智能体节点生成的任何工具调用。
Its sole purpose is to execute any tool calls that the call agent node generated.

2149
04:07:25,742 --> 04:07:31,556
它接收我们之前定义的工具列表，并处理实际的函数执行。
It takes the list of tools we defined earlier and handles the actual function execution.

2150
04:07:31,982 --> 04:07:34,052
接下来是智能体后的路由。
Next, route after agent.

2151
04:07:34,510 --> 04:07:36,420
这是一个简单的路由函数。
This is a simple routing function.

2152
04:07:36,878 --> 04:07:50,820
在调用智能体节点运行后，此函数会查看状态值，以确定图接下来是去工具节点执行工具，
还是如果智能体已有最终回复就直接结束。
After the call agent node runs, this function looks at the state value to determine whether the graph should go next,
either to the tools node for tool execution, or directly to end if the agent has a final response.

2153
04:07:51,406 --> 04:07:53,124
接下来是构建图。
Next is building the graph.

2154
