is the complete transparency it offers through logs and activity traces.

2978
05:30:31,392 --> 05:30:41,572
因此，每当智能体执行任务时，无论是规划、浏览、提取数据，甚至是分析内容，
你都可以查看它所采取的详细步骤。
So whenever an agent performs a task, whether it's planning, browsing, extracting
data, or even analyzing the content, you can view the detailed steps it takes.

2979
05:30:42,032 --> 05:30:51,716
活动轨迹包括每一次浏览器交互、点击的链接、滚动行为、提取的文本，
以及到达最终输出所选择的路径。
The activity traces include every browser interaction, the links clicked, the scroll behavior, the extracted text,
and the path chosen to reach the final output.

2980
05:30:52,622 --> 05:30:55,780
这能帮你理解智能体为什么做出某些决策。
This helps you understand why the agent made certain decisions.

2981
05:30:56,654 --> 05:31:05,924
这些日志还会揭示中间推理步骤，比如智能体决定优化搜索，或者可能访问网页的某个部分。
So these logs also reveal intermediate reasoning steps, such as the
agent deciding to refine a search or maybe visit a section of a web page.

2982
05:31:06,350 --> 05:31:09,712
这种可见程度让调试变得容易得多。
This level of visibility makes debugging much easier.

2983
05:31:10,030 --> 05:31:16,164
如果智能体误解了你的目标或提取了错误的内容，你可以精准定位问题发生的位置。
If the agent misinterprets your goal or extracts the wrong content, you can pinpoint where the issue occurred.

2984
05:31:16,622 --> 05:31:21,380
活动轨迹就像是智能体在整个过程和行动中的时间轴。
The activity traces act as a timeline for the agent through the process and actions.

2985
05:31:21,710 --> 05:31:27,108
随着时间的推移，回顾这些轨迹将帮助你设计更好的目标和更高效的工作流。
Over time, reviewing these traces will help you design better goals and more efficient workflows.

2986
05:31:27,790 --> 05:31:33,952
虽然 ChatGPT 智能体系统旨在提供无缝体验，但你偶尔可能会遇到一些设置问题。
Even though the ChatGPT agent system is designed to be seamless, you may occasionally encounter some setup issues.

2987
05:31:34,318 --> 05:31:37,188
让我们来看看最常见的问题以及如何解决它们。
Let's go through the most common problems and how to resolve them.

2988
05:31:37,774 --> 05:31:40,592
一个常见问题是智能体模式无法激活。
A frequent issue is agent mode not activating.

2989
05:31:40,814 --> 05:31:47,460
这通常是因为浏览器权限被禁用，所以请确保你已允许 ChatGPT 在当前会话中浏览网络。
This usually happens when browser permissions are disabled, so make sure you have allowed ChatGPT to browse the web in your session.

2990
05:31:48,078 --> 05:31:52,676
如果你无法提取或上传内容，请检查你的文件访问设置。
If you are unable to extract or upload content, check your file access settings.

2991
05:31:53,582 --> 05:31:58,980
某些组织也会屏蔽文件处理或限制外部工具用户。
Certain organizations block file handling or restrict external tool users as well.

2992
05:31:59,534 --> 05:32:02,628
另一个常见问题是功能不可用。
Another common issue is feature unavailability.

2993
05:32:03,054 --> 05:32:11,140
如果你使用的是免费计划或受管理的工程空间，智
能体功能可能会根据你的计划或管理政策受到限制。
If you are on a free plan or using a managed workspace, agent features
may be restricted based on your plan or administrative policies.

2994
05:32:11,822 --> 05:32:18,660
有时由于网络限制或网站屏蔽自动浏览，智能体无法加载网页。
Sometimes the agent cannot load a web page due to network restrictions or because the website blocks automated browsing.

2995
05:32:19,246 --> 05:32:23,844
在这种情况下，你可以重新表述目标或选择其他可用的来源。
So, in such cases, rephrase the goal or choose another source that can help.

2996
05:32:24,494 --> 05:32:30,500
排查这些问题可以确保你在开始使用高级智能体工作流时获得更顺畅的体验。
Troubleshooting these areas ensures a smoother experience as you begin working with advanced agentic workflows.

2997
05:32:31,310 --> 05:32:35,008
大多数智能体失败并不是因为 AI 能力弱。
Most agent failures don't happen because AI is weak.

2998
05:32:35,342 --> 05:32:37,828
这些问题之所以发生，是因为指令不清晰。
They happen because instructions are unclear.

2999
05:32:38,208 --> 05:32:42,928
所以在这一节中，你将学习如何像管理者一样去思考 AI 智能体。
So in this session, you will learn how to think like a manager for AI agents.

3000
05:32:43,182 --> 05:32:50,368
所以如果你想要可预测、可靠的结果，而不是随机的输出，掌握这项技能是必不可少的。
So if you want predictable, reliable results instead of random outputs, mastering this skill is non-negotiable.

3001
05:32:50,574 --> 05:32:55,108
在与智能体协作时，你提示词的质量决定了输出的质量。
When working with agents, the quality of your prompt determines the quality of the output.

3002
05:32:55,694 --> 05:32:57,444
这非常明确，对吧？
This is very clear, right?

3003
05:32:57,934 --> 05:33:02,928
所以多步骤提示词能帮助智能体不仅理解做什么，还能理解怎么做。
So multi-step prompts help the agent understand not just what, but also the how.

3004
05:33:03,408 --> 05:33:06,148
那么让我们来看看如何有效地构建这些提示词。
So let's walk through how to structure them effectively.

3005
05:33:06,688 --> 05:33:10,372
每一个智能体任务都始于一个清晰、具体的目标。
Every agent task begins with a clear, specific goal.

3006
05:33:10,862 --> 05:33:20,612
所以与其说“研究 Cloud 平台”，更好的目标是“根据价格、
功能和支持情况对比 AWS、Azure 和 Google Cloud”。
So instead of saying research cloud platforms, a better goal would be
compare AWS, Azure, and Google Cloud based on pricing, features, and support.

3007
05:33:21,168 --> 05:33:23,620
接下来，概述任务的各个阶段。
Next, outline the stages of the task.

3008
05:33:23,950 --> 05:33:31,620
例如，识别核心功能，收集价格信息，对比支持服务，然后生成汇总表。
For example, identify top features, gather pricing information, compare support offerings, and then produce a summary table.

3009
05:33:32,128 --> 05:33:36,900
提供这样的结构可以让智能体的执行更加准确和可靠。
Providing a structure like this makes the agent's execution more accurate and reliable.

3010
05:33:37,488 --> 05:33:40,368
然后还要定义预期的输出格式。
Then define the expected output format as well.

3011
05:33:40,654 --> 05:33:44,964
结果应该是表格、列表，还是结构化的报告？
Should the result be a table, it should be a list, or it should be a structured report.

3012
05:33:45,408 --> 05:33:49,540
输出的清晰度能确保最终交付的内容符合你的预期。
Output clarity ensures the final deliverable aligns with your expectations.

3013
05:33:50,414 --> 05:33:57,444
最后，如有必要，加入约束条件或特殊指令，比如字数限制、时间段或来源要求。
Finally, include constraints or special instructions if necessary, such as word limits, time periods, or source requirements.

3014
05:33:58,190 --> 05:34:03,908
这为编写能带来一致、高质量结果的智能体提示词奠定了基础。
This sets the foundation for writing agent prompts that lead to consistent, high-quality results.

3015
05:34:04,398 --> 05:34:10,180
在给智能体分配任务时，你能做的最重要的事情之一就是划定清晰的边界。
When assigning tasks to an agent, one of the most important things you can do is to find clear boundaries.

3016
05:34:10,830 --> 05:34:18,372
如果没有边界，智能体可能会过度分析并收集无关数据，有时甚至会误解你的意图。
Without boundaries, the agent may overanalyze and gather irrelevant data, or sometimes even misinterpret your intentions.

3017
05:34:19,086 --> 05:34:21,348
所以首先要定义范围。
So start by defining the scope.

3018
05:34:21,710 --> 05:34:24,868
智能体应该包含什么，又应该避免什么？
What should the agent include and what should it avoid?

3019
05:34:25,168 --> 05:34:32,612
例如，在总结一个主题时，明确你想要学术资源、新闻文章还是产品网站。
For example, when summarizing a topic, specify whether you want academic sources, news articles, or product websites.

3020
05:34:33,582 --> 05:34:35,728
接下来，你应该定义限制。
Next, you should define the limits.

3021
05:34:36,078 --> 05:34:44,516
这可能包括要检查的网站数量、最终输出的长度、分析的深度、时间范围以及来源限制。
This may include the number of websites to check, length of the final
output, depth of the analysis, time ranges, and source restrictions.

3022
05:34:45,070 --> 05:34:48,132
这些边界能帮助智能体保持专注并提高效率。
These boundaries help the agent stay focused and efficient.

3023
05:34:48,608 --> 05:34:52,516
明确智能体不应该执行的行动也很有用。
It's also useful to clarify actions the agent should not perform.

3024
05:34:52,878 --> 05:34:58,368
例如，不要访问登录受限的页面，或者避免促销内容。
For example, do not access login restricted pages, or avoid promotional content.

3025
05:34:58,766 --> 05:35:01,008
最后，加入检查点。
Finally, include the checkpoints.

3026
05:35:01,294 --> 05:35:04,836
这些是智能体停下来核实自己是否在正确的轨道上的时刻。
These are moments when the agent pauses to verify it's on the right track.

3027
05:35:05,168 --> 05:35:08,996
这些可以防止浪费精力，并确保整个任务过程中的一致性。
These prevent wasted effort and ensure alignment throughout the task.

3028
05:35:09,678 --> 05:35:12,900
明确的边界能带来可预测且准确的结果。
Clear boundaries lead to predictable, accurate results.

3029
05:35:13,934 --> 05:35:18,020
上下文文件是提升智能体性能最有效的方法之一。
Context files are one of the most powerful ways to improve agent performance.

3030
05:35:18,670 --> 05:35:30,820
所以当你上传 PDF、教科书、研究论文甚至课程幻灯片时，
你就是给智能体提供了高质量的特定领域信息供其处理。
So when you upload files like PDFs or any textbook or any research paper, or even the
course slides, you give the agent high-quality, domain-specific information to work with.

3031
05:35:31,502 --> 05:35:39,812
智能体可以提取重要概念、扫描关键词、识别模式，并利用这些信息来产出准确的结果。
Agents can extract important concepts, scan for keywords, identify patterns, and use this information to produce accurate results.

3032
05:35:40,430 --> 05:35:47,728
例如，上传教学大纲或培训手册可以让智能体生成符合现有标准的内容。
For example, uploading a syllabus or training manual allows the agent to generate content that aligns with existing standards.

3033
05:35:48,110 --> 05:35:54,916
这在教育、企业工作流、产品文档和合规性任务中特别有用。
This is particularly useful in education, corporate workflows, product documentation, and compliance tasks.

3034
05:35:55,406 --> 05:36:01,508
智能体不再仅仅依赖网络搜索或通用知识，而是基于你提供的精确材料来工作。
Instead of relying solely on web search or generic knowledge, the agent works with your precise materials.

3035
05:36:02,094 --> 05:36:08,964
只要可能，就附上相关文件，以确保更好的上下文、更高的准确性和更个性化的输出。
Wherever possible, attach relevant files to ensure better context, higher accuracy, and more personalized outputs.

3036
05:36:09,486 --> 05:36:12,708
常用的模板可以节省时间并标准化你的工作流。
Common templates save time and standardize your workflow.

3037
05:36:13,006 --> 05:36:18,916
所以你不需要每次都重新编写指令，而是可以为常见任务重复使用结构化的格式。
So instead of reinventing instructions every time, you can reuse structured formats for common tasks.

3038
05:36:19,630 --> 05:36:26,692
研究模板可能包括识别来源、提取事实和总结发现等步骤。
A research template might include steps like identifying sources, extracting facts, and summarizing findings.

3039
05:36:27,248 --> 05:36:34,148
对比模板则会规定对比标准、来源数量以及所需的表格格式。
A comparison template would specify the criteria to compare, the number of sources, and the desired table format.

3040
05:36:34,734 --> 05:36:40,260
正如屏幕上显示的，这些就是你可以用于研究或对比任务的模板。
As you can see on the screen, these are the templates that you can use for your research or comparison tasks.

3041
05:36:40,768 --> 05:36:45,572
总结模板将定义阅读长度、目标受众和风格。
A summarization template would define reading length, target audience, and style.

3042
05:36:46,158 --> 05:36:58,596
内容创作模板可能包括语气、结构和字数，通过保存并重复使用模板，你可以确保任务的一致性，
并随着时间的推移提高智能体的性能。
A content creation template might include tone, structure, and word count, so by saving and reusing templates,
you ensure consistency across tasks and improve the agent's performance over time.

3043
05:36:59,534 --> 05:37:04,912
智能体模式需要更明确的提示词，因为它与真实的网页进行交互。
Agent mode requires more explicit prompting because it interacts with real web pages.

3044
05:37:05,262 --> 05:37:12,804
现在让我们重点看看如何编写高级提示词来引导智能体的行为，
或者我可以说引导智能体的浏览行为。
So now let's focus on how to write advanced prompts that guide the agent's behavior, or I could say agent's browsing behavior.

3045
05:37:13,262 --> 05:37:19,748
首先提供清晰的浏览指令，例如访问哪个网站或搜索哪个关键词。
So start by providing clear browsing instructions, such as which site to visit or what keyword to search.

3046
05:37:20,142 --> 05:37:22,592
然后定义提取模式。
Then define the extraction patterns.

3047
05:37:22,830 --> 05:37:26,468
例如，仅从定价部分提取价格详情。
For example, extract pricing details from the pricing section only.

3048
05:37:27,182 --> 05:37:29,472
必要时指定操作步骤。
Specify instruction steps when needed.

3049
05:37:29,806 --> 05:37:38,564
例如，步骤可以是打开网站，导航到特定的定价页面，从中提取关键功能，然后总结这些发现。
For example, the steps could be open the website, navigate to the particular
pricing page, extract the key features from it, and then summarize those findings.

3050
05:37:39,118 --> 05:37:41,232
最后，添加验证规则。
Finally, add validation rules.

3051
05:37:41,614 --> 05:37:47,524
要求智能体验证提取的信息是否准确，或者多个来源是否一致。
Ask the agent to verify whether the extracted information is accurate or whether multiple sources agree to it.

3052
05:37:48,078 --> 05:37:54,500
高级提示词工程可以确保智能体模式在不同网站上表现一致且智能。
Advanced prompting ensures that agent mode behaves consistently and intelligently across websites.

3053
05:37:54,862 --> 05:37:59,940
虽然智能体功能强大，但可靠性取决于你如何设计任务。
Even though agents are powerful, reliability depends on how you design your tasks.

3054
05:38:00,174 --> 05:38:02,820
所以首先要避免模糊的目标。
So start by avoiding vague objectives.

3055
05:38:03,118 --> 05:38:13,316
与其说“研究 AI 工具”，正如我之前提到的，不如明确要
求“识别教育中使用的五种 AI 工具并对比它们的功能”。
Instead of saying research AI tools, I have also mentioned this prior,
specify identify five AI tools used in education and compare their features.

3056
05:38:13,838 --> 05:38:16,832
现在，将复杂任务分解成较小的部分。
Now, divide complex tasks into smaller parts.

3057
05:38:17,198 --> 05:38:20,228
当工作流是模块化的时候，智能体的表现最好。
An agent performs best when the workflow is modular.

3058
05:38:20,654 --> 05:38:24,644
使用检查点来确保智能体能够暂停并核实方向。
Use checkpoints to ensure the agent pauses and verifies direction.

3059
05:38:25,038 --> 05:38:27,332
这可以防止漂移或误解。
This prevents drift or misinterpretation.

3060
05:38:27,982 --> 05:38:30,916
要求智能体在执行之前说明其假设。
Ask the agent to state assumptions before executing.

3061
05:38:31,278 --> 05:38:33,412
这有助于及早发现误解。
This helps catch misunderstandings early.

3062
05:38:33,966 --> 05:38:40,352
最后，始终要求结构化响应、表格、项目符号列表、摘要或报告。
Lastly, always request structured responses, tables, bullet lists, summaries, or reports.

3063
05:38:40,718 --> 05:38:44,388
结构化能确保清晰度，并让结果更易于阅读。
Structure ensures clarity and makes results easier to consume.

3064
05:38:45,006 --> 05:38:46,592
现在让我们总结一下这一节的内容。
Let's summarize the session now.

3065
05:38:46,958 --> 05:38:52,260
你学习了如何通过定义目标、阶段和输出格式来构建多步骤提示词。
You learned how to structure multi-step prompts by defining goals, stages, and output format.

3066
05:38:52,814 --> 05:38:57,220
这能确保智能体按清晰、逻辑化的顺序执行任务。
This ensures agents execute tasks in a clear, logical sequence.

3067
05:38:57,678 --> 05:39:04,676
我们还探讨了边界如何让智能体保持专注，并防止不必要的探索或误解。
We also explored how boundaries keep the agent focused and prevent unnecessary exploration or misinterpretation.

3068
05:39:05,614 --> 05:39:08,752
上下文文件在准确性方面起着重要作用。
Context files play an important role in accuracy.

3069
05:39:09,134 --> 05:39:14,404
当你上传材料时，智能体就可以利用高质量的特定领域信息进行工作。
When you upload materials, the agent can work with high-quality domain-specific information.

3070
05:39:15,278 --> 05:39:18,948
可重复使用的模板可以节省时间并标准化你的工作流。
Reusable templates save time and standardize your workflows.

3071
05:39:19,406 --> 05:39:24,964
这些模板可以应用于研究、对比、总结和内容创作。
These templates can be applied to research, comparison, summarization, and content creation.

3072
05:39:25,902 --> 05:39:29,540
在操作智能体模式时，高级提示词工程技术至关重要。
Advanced prompting techniques are crucial when working with agent mode.

3073
05:39:29,870 --> 05:39:37,028
清晰的浏览指令、提取模式和验证步骤可以帮助智能体有效地与网页交互。
Clear browsing instructions, extraction patterns, and validation steps help the agent interact effectively with web pages.

3074
05:39:37,966 --> 05:39:40,672
最后，可靠性源于结构。
Finally, reliability comes from structure.

3075
05:39:40,910 --> 05:39:49,668
因此，通过将任务分解为阶段、增加检查点并要求结构化的结果，
你可以帮助智能体产出一致且高质量的输出。
So by breaking tasks into stages, adding checkpoints, and demanding structured
results, you help the agent produce consistent, high-quality outputs.

3076
05:39:49,952 --> 05:39:53,392
现在，这就是理论转化为实际价值的地方。
Now, this is where theory turns into real value.

3077
05:39:53,710 --> 05:39:58,512
所以在这节课中，我们将停止空谈智能体，而是真正去使用它们。
