3363
06:08:43,726 --> 06:08:51,364
那么，让我们从了解在与任何 AI 智能体协作时最常见的问题之一开始，那就是智能体卡住了。
So let's begin this session by understanding one of the most common issues
you'll face while working with any AI agent, the agent getting stuck.

3364
06:08:51,886 --> 06:08:54,468
这并不意味着智能体本身有故障。
So this doesn't mean the agent is faulty.

3365
06:08:54,734 --> 06:09:00,420
它仅仅意味着任务的框架不是智能体能够持续理解或执行的方式。
It simply means the task was not framed in a way the agent could consistently interpret or execute.

3366
06:09:01,102 --> 06:09:04,592
第一个也是最常见的原因是模糊目标。
The first and most frequent reason is ambiguous goals.

3367
06:09:04,974 --> 06:09:17,572
如果指令很模糊，比如“研究 AI 工具”，智能体就不知道你期望的范围、深度、质量或格式，
它可能会在尝试满足你的请求时产生漂移或陷入循环。
If the instruction is vague, such as research AI tools, the agent doesn't know the scope, depth, quality, or format you expect,
and it may drift or loop in the attempts to satisfy your request.

3368
06:09:18,222 --> 06:09:20,432
另一个原因是缺失上下文。
Another cause is missing context.

3369
06:09:20,750 --> 06:09:29,892
所以，如果你要求智能体总结并对比一份文档，但你从未上传那份文档，
模型会尝试猜测你的意图并卡住。
So if you ask an agent to maybe summarize a document and compare it, but you never attach the document,
the model will attempt to guess your intention and get stuck.

3370
06:09:30,638 --> 06:09:34,912
当对网站结构存在错误假设时，智能体也会遇到困难。
Agents also struggle when there is an incorrect assumption about a website's structure.

3371
06:09:35,246 --> 06:09:43,632
网站是动态的，菜单可能被隐藏，内容可能隐藏在交互操作之后，
或者某些元素可能在沙箱环境中无法正确加载。
Websites are dynamic, menus may be hidden, content could be behind interactions,
or some elements may not load correctly in the sandbox environment.

3372
06:09:44,046 --> 06:09:48,996
如果智能体期望某些不存在的元素，它可能会暂停或重复步骤。
If the agent expects certain elements that are not present, it may pause or repeat steps.

3373
06:09:49,550 --> 06:10:00,996
冲突约束，比如要求简短简单的解释，但又要求详
细引用，也可能导致混淆，从而导致输出不完整。
Conflicting constraints, such as asking for a short, simple explanation, but also requiring detailed citation,
can also cause confusion that leads to incomplete outputs.

3374
06:10:01,902 --> 06:10:04,292
最后，技术限制也很重要。
Finally, technical limitations matter.

3375
06:10:04,878 --> 06:10:11,908
网站可能会拦截自动化爬虫，加载缓慢，或者弹出干扰导航的窗口。
Websites may block automated scraping, load slowly, or present pop-ups that interfere with the navigation.

3376
06:10:12,320 --> 06:10:16,388
智能体模式还可能面临工具限制或超时。
The agent mode may also face tool restrictions or timeouts.

3377
06:10:17,198 --> 06:10:23,332
了解这些原因可以帮助你快速诊断问题，并更有效地重新设计任务。
Understanding these causes helps you diagnose problems quickly and redesign tasks more effectively.

3378
06:10:23,918 --> 06:10:31,588
当智能体停滞、循环或产生不完整结果时，好消息是，修复方法通常很简单。
When an agent stalls, loops, or produces incomplete results, the good news is that the fix is usually simple.

3379
06:10:31,918 --> 06:10:36,560
第一个也是最有效的策略是更清晰地重写目标。
The first and most effective strategy is to rewrite the goal with more clarity.

3380
06:10:36,910 --> 06:10:42,788
与其给宽泛的指令，不如明确范围、要求的深度和输出格式。
Instead of broad instructions, specify the scope, required depth and output format.

3381
06:10:43,374 --> 06:10:46,400
另一种方法是拆解复杂工作流。
Another approach is to break down complex workflows.

3382
06:10:46,766 --> 06:10:56,388
如果一个任务涉及太多行动，比如研究、对比、分析，然后再生成建议，
智能体可能会失去对流程的掌控。
If a task involves too many actions, like researching, comparing, analyzing,
and then generating recommendations, the agent might lose track of the flow.

3383
06:10:56,750 --> 06:11:01,220
将任务拆分为更小的阶段可以提高稳定性并提高准确性。
Splitting the task into smaller stages improves stability and accuracy.

3384
06:11:01,934 --> 06:11:08,240
如果你的任务引用了文档、幻灯片或数据集，请确保附带了所需的上下文。
If your task references documents, slides, or a data set, ensure the required context is attached.

3385
06:11:08,654 --> 06:11:17,092
智能体只能处理它们有权访问的信息，因此添加文件或澄清缺失的细节通常能立即解决混淆。
Agents can only work with the information they have access to, so adding
files or clarifying missing details often resolves confusion immediately.

3386
06:11:17,838 --> 06:11:20,548
有时你设置的约束过于严格。
Sometimes the constraints you set are too restrictive.

3387
06:11:20,846 --> 06:11:26,564
例如，要求一个包含 10 个技术点的 200 字总结可能并不可行。
For example, asking for a 200-word summary that includes 10 technical points may not be feasible.

3388
06:11:27,182 --> 06:11:31,748
在这种情况下，放宽约束可以帮助智能体更灵活地思考。
In such cases, loosening constraints helps the agent think more flexibly.

3389
06:11:32,238 --> 06:11:39,716
最后，如果智能体产生了错误的假设，比如认为网页布局不同，就温和地纠正它。
Finally, if the agent makes incorrect assumptions, like expecting a web page layout to be different, gently correct it.

3390
06:11:40,078 --> 06:11:47,332
你可以说，忽略左侧导航栏，或者你可以说，继续向下滚动，价格表在页面下方。
You can say, ignore the left navigation bar, or you can say, scroll further, the pricing table is lower on the page.

3391
06:11:48,014 --> 06:11:54,596
通过加入这些调整，你将大幅降低智能体的失败率并提高任务的可靠性。
By incorporating these adjustments, you will drastically reduce agent failure rates and improve the task reliability.

3392
06:11:55,630 --> 06:12:00,228
当你用正确的结构引导模型时，智能体的表现会显著提升。
Agent performance improves dramatically when you guide the model with the right structure.

3393
06:12:00,558 --> 06:12:04,400
所以，智能体对明确的指令反应非常好。
So agents respond exceptionally well to explicit instructions.

3394
06:12:04,718 --> 06:12:07,492
步骤越清晰，执行就越顺畅。
The clearer the steps, the smoother the execution.

3395
06:12:08,238 --> 06:12:15,556
使用表格、列表或项目符号等结构化格式，可以帮助智能体理解你期望的输出类型。
Using structured formats, such as table, list, or bullet points, helps the agent understand what type of output you expect.

3396
06:12:16,078 --> 06:12:21,600
如果你指定，生成一个包含功能、价格和局限性的三列对比表。
If you specify, generate a three-column table comparing feature, pricing, and limitation.

3397
06:12:21,934 --> 06:12:24,484
智能体就会准确知道如何呈现这些信息。
The agent knows exactly how to frame the information.

3398
06:12:25,262 --> 06:12:27,908
加入检查点是另一种强大的技术。
Including checkpoints is another powerful technique.

3399
06:12:28,430 --> 06:12:35,012
你可以指示智能体在每个主要步骤后暂停，并在继续之前请求你的确认。
You can instruct the agent to pause after each major step and ask for your confirmation before proceeding.

3400
06:12:35,534 --> 06:12:39,716
这可以减少错误，并防止智能体走向错误的方向。
This reduces errors and prevents the agent from heading in the wrong direction.

3401
06:12:40,558 --> 06:12:42,596
要求提供推理摘要。
Asking for a reasoning summary.

3402
06:12:42,990 --> 06:12:48,320
例如，如果你给出的提示词是这样的，就在开始前解释你的方法。
So, for example, explain your approach before starting, if this is the prompt you give.

3403
06:12:48,622 --> 06:12:52,900
这将有助于或确保智能体正确理解了你的指令。
This will help or ensure the agent understood your instructions correctly.

3404
06:12:53,454 --> 06:12:59,044
如果推理摘要显示出误解，你可以在执行前纠正智能体。
If the reasoning summary reveals a misunderstanding, you can correct the agent before execution.

3405
06:12:59,918 --> 06:13:04,772
最后，提供优秀的输出示例可以为智能体提供一个可以模仿的模型。
Finally, giving examples of good output provides a model that the agent can mirror.

3406
06:13:05,230 --> 06:13:12,548
如果你想要特定的语气、格式或结构，展示一个参考示例能大大提高一致性和准确性。
If you want a certain tone, format, or structure, showing a reference example greatly improves consistency and accuracy.

3407
06:13:13,390 --> 06:13:21,348
这些技术可以帮助智能体更快、更准确、更可靠地执行任务，尤其是在多步骤工作流中。
These techniques help the agent perform tasks faster, more accurately, and more reliably, especially during multi-step workflows.

3408
06:13:22,286 --> 06:13:27,120
尽管 Auto GPT 智能体功能强大，但它在某些界限内运行。
Even though the Auto GPT agent is powerful, it operates within certain boundaries.

3409
06:13:27,406 --> 06:13:33,252
所以了解这些局限性可以帮助你设计符合系统实际能力的任务。
So understanding these limitations helps you design tasks that align with what the system can realistically do.

3410
06:13:34,030 --> 06:13:38,468
其中一个主要的局限性是无法访问基于登录的平台。
So one major limitation is restricted access to login-based platforms.

3411
06:13:38,990 --> 06:13:47,524
所以如果数据在身份验证之后，比如学生仪表盘、CRM系统或付费订阅网站，智能体就无法访问它。
So if Dita is behind authentication, such as a student dashboard, CRM system, or paid subscription sites, the agent cannot access it.

3412
06:13:48,014 --> 06:13:54,948
例如，要求它从 Udemy 账户下载价格 PDF，这是行不通的，因为它需要登录。
So for example, asking it to download the pricing PDF from the Udemy account, this will not work because it requires login.

3413
06:13:55,630 --> 06:14:02,000
智能体也难以处理模糊的目标，经常会产生导致错误结果的假设。
Agents also struggle with vague goals, often creating assumptions that lead to incorrect results.

3414
06:14:02,446 --> 06:14:14,480
例如，如果你说，找出最好的 AI 工具，但没指定预算、行业或使用场景等标准，
智能体可能会生成通用的或不匹配的列表。
For example, if you say, find the best AI tools without specifying criteria like budget, industry, or use case,
the agent may generate a generic or misaligned list.

3415
06:14:15,182 --> 06:14:18,800
另一个局限性是处理结构糟糕的网页。
Another limitation is handling poorly structured web pages.

3416
06:14:19,182 --> 06:14:25,860
如果内容隐藏在交互式菜单或动态脚本之后，智能体可能会误解页面布局。
If content is hidden behind interactive menus or dynamic scripts, the agent may misinterpret the page layout.

3417
06:14:26,382 --> 06:14:34,564
例如，从一个只有在用户交互后才渲染内容的网站提取价格，可能会导致数据缺失或不完整。
For example, extracting pricing from a site that renders content only after user interaction may lead to missing or incomplete data.

3418
06:14:35,502 --> 06:14:37,648
搜索依赖是另一个挑战。
Search dependency is another challenge.

3419
06:14:37,998 --> 06:14:42,128
AutoGPT 智能体高度依赖公开索引内容。
The AutoGPT agent relies heavily on publicly indexed content.

3420
06:14:42,446 --> 06:14:48,548
所以如果搜索结果过时或具有误导性，智能体可能会无意中使用低质量的来源。
So if search results are outdated or misleading, the agent may unintentionally use low-quality sources.

3421
06:14:49,326 --> 06:14:53,248
最后，智能体无法运行长周期的持久工作流。
Finally, the agent cannot run long-duration persistent workflows.

3422
06:14:53,454 --> 06:14:57,248
比如你要求它，在接下来的一周里每小时监控一次这个网站。
Like if you say, monitor this website every hour for the next week.

3423
06:14:57,582 --> 06:15:00,932
它会执行这个任务，但仅在受限执行窗口内。
It performs this task, but within a bounded execution window.

3424
06:15:01,488 --> 06:15:08,772
所以了解这些局限性可以帮助你设计出与智能体配合而非对抗的任务。
So understanding these limitations prepares you to design tasks that work with the agent rather than against it.

3425
06:15:09,408 --> 06:15:13,604
现在，让我为你演示一下这些局限性在现实中是如何体现的。
Now, let me demonstrate all these limitations in reality for you.

3426
06:15:14,414 --> 06:15:18,692
那么让我们从一个非常常见的局限性开始，这也是我之前讨论过的。
So let's start with a very common limitation, which I already discussed.

3427
06:15:19,408 --> 06:15:25,988
Auto GPT 智能体可以浏览公共网站，但它无法登录受保护的平台。
Auto GPT agent can browse public websites, but it cannot log in to protected platforms.

3428
06:15:26,830 --> 06:15:32,068
我会故意要求它获取登录后的信息，来向你们展示会发生什么。
I'll intentionally ask it to access information behind a login to show you what happens.

3429
06:15:32,686 --> 06:15:36,868
这个提示词要求从一个需要身份验证的网站获取数据。
So this prompt requests data from a website that requires authentication.

3430
06:15:37,390 --> 06:15:42,852
虽然任务听起来很简单，但智能体会被拦截，这就是预期的行为。
Even though the task sounds simple, the agent will be blocked, and that's the expected behavior.

3431
06:15:43,374 --> 06:15:44,420
现在我运行一下。
Now I'll run this.

3432
06:15:45,038 --> 06:15:49,808
注意看智能体尝试执行任务，但因为登录限制而无法继续。
Notice how the agent attempts the task but cannot proceed due to login restrictions.

3433
06:15:50,158 --> 06:15:53,248
这是一个内置的局限性，不是 Bug。
This is a built-in limitation, and it is not a bug.

3434
06:15:53,486 --> 06:15:54,628
请记住这一点。
Please keep this in mind.

3435
06:15:55,502 --> 06:15:59,248
现在我们停下来，看看这个输出里发生了什么。
Now let's pause here and understand what's happening in this output.

3436
06:15:59,694 --> 06:16:05,636
我要求 AutoGPT 智能体登录一个付费平台并提取最低课程价格。
So I ask the AutoGPT agent to log in to a paid platform and extract minimum course pricing.

3437
06:16:06,158 --> 06:16:07,888
它问我该在哪里登录。
It asks me where to log in.

3438
06:16:08,238 --> 06:16:10,404
我给它提供了一个平台，LinkedIn Learning。
I gave it a platform, LinkedIn Learning.

3439
06:16:10,958 --> 06:16:16,196
现在，智能体立即解释说它无法代表我登录或使用凭据。
Now, the agent immediately explains that it cannot log in or use credentials on my behalf.

3440
06:16:16,590 --> 06:16:18,048
这不是失败。
And this is not a failure.

3441
06:16:18,286 --> 06:16:21,092
这是刻意的安全和隐私边界。
It is intentional safety and privacy boundaries.

3442
06:16:21,550 --> 06:16:25,764
然而，智能体并没有完全停止，而是做了一些聪明的操作。
However, instead of stopping completely, the agent does something intelligent.

3443
06:16:26,222 --> 06:16:33,572
也就是说，它切换到公开可用的信息，并清楚地告诉我们它能访问什么以及不能访问什么。
That is, it switches to publicly available information and clearly tells us what it can and cannot access.

3444
06:16:34,158 --> 06:16:44,608
所以它解释了 LinkedIn Learning 的订阅模式，列出了公开可见的 AI 课程，
并提供了大概的价格，而且全程没有突破安全边界。
So it explains LinkedIn learning subscription model, lists publicly visible AI
courses, and provides approximate pricing, all without crossing security boundaries.

3445
06:16:44,942 --> 06:16:54,084
所以这里的关键点是，Auto GPT 智能体在处理公共数据时表现良好，
但任何登录后的内容都需要人工参与。
So the key takeaway here is Auto GPT Agent works well with public data, but anything behind a login requires human involvement.

3446
06:16:54,958 --> 06:16:59,328
现在我给你们看看当目标本身非常模糊时会发生什么。
Now I'll show you what happens when the goal itself is very unclear.

3447
06:16:59,630 --> 06:17:02,208
所以智能体不太擅长猜测意图。
So agents don't guess intent well.

3448
06:17:02,510 --> 06:17:05,008
模糊的指令会导致不可预测的结果。
Ambiguity leads to unpredictable results.

3449
06:17:05,230 --> 06:17:07,648
我在这一节课中已经多次强调过这一点了。
I have told this many times throughout this session.

3450
06:17:08,078 --> 06:17:11,648
所以你可以看到，这个提示词故意缺乏具体细节。
So you can see this prompt intentionally lacks specificity.

3451
06:17:11,886 --> 06:17:15,748
没有明确的范围，没有限制条件，也没有定义好的输出。
There's no clear scope, no constraints, and no defined output.

3452
06:17:16,270 --> 06:17:23,492
我现在运行这个提示词，看看智能体在决定具体研究什么或深入到什么程度时会遇到怎样的困难。
I'll execute this prompt now and watch how the agent struggles to decide what exactly to research or how deep to go.

3453
06:17:24,238 --> 06:17:25,728
现在让我们看看输出结果。
Now let's look at the output.

3454
06:17:26,062 --> 06:17:28,368
我给智能体的目标非常宽泛。
The goal I gave the agent was very broad.

3455
06:17:28,622 --> 06:17:34,372
研究 AI 工具并提供见解，但没有指定范围、深度或受众。
Research AI tools and give the insights, without specifying the scope, depth, or audience.

3456
06:17:35,086 --> 06:17:37,728
正因为如此，注意一下智能体是怎么做的。
Because of that, notice what the agent does.

3457
06:17:38,062 --> 06:17:46,048
它先提出了澄清问题，并在获得许可后，生成了一个非常宽泛且通用的市场概况。
It asks clarifying questions first, and when allowed to proceed, it produces a very wide, generic market overview.

3458
06:17:46,446 --> 06:17:50,436
输出结果没有错，但也不够聚焦。
The output is not wrong, but it's not sharply focused either.

3459
06:17:50,766 --> 06:17:56,128
如你所见，我们得到了类别、价格范围、趋势和示例。
As you can see, we get categories, pricing ranges, trends, and examples.

3460
06:17:56,462 --> 06:18:00,996
但其中并没有明确的优先级，也没有可以直接用于决策的见解。
But no clear prioritization or decision-ready insights is there.

3461
06:18:01,582 --> 06:18:04,420
所以这展示了一个重要的原则。
So this demonstrates an important principle.

3462
06:18:04,782 --> 06:18:07,780
智能体不会像人类那样去推断意图。
Agents don't infer intent the way humans do.

3463
06:18:08,048 --> 06:18:13,156
如果目标不精确，输出就会变得宽泛，有时甚至让人不知所措。
If the goal is not precise, the output becomes broad and sometimes overwhelming.

3464
06:18:13,568 --> 06:18:18,724
因此，在与智能体协作时，前期的清晰度直接决定了输出的质量。
So when working with agents, clarity up front directly controls output quality.

3465
06:18:19,088 --> 06:18:21,728
智能体高度依赖页面结构。
Agents rely heavily on page structure.

3466
06:18:21,968 --> 06:18:26,820
如果网站布局复杂或不一致，提取过程就可能出错。
If the website layout is complex or inconsistent, extraction can go wrong.

3467
06:18:27,248 --> 06:18:30,564
这是下一个局限性，我将向大家演示一下。
So this is the next limitation, which I'm going to demonstrate to you.

3468
06:18:31,008 --> 06:18:38,724
如你所见，这个提示词要求智能体从布局各异的页面中提取结构化数据，这经常会导致匹配错误。
As you can see, this prompt asks the agent to extract structured data from pages with varying layout, which often causes mismatches.

3469
06:18:39,246 --> 06:18:40,068
我现在运行一下。
I'll run this now.

3470
06:18:40,608 --> 06:18:45,540
注意有些价格可能缺失、错误，或者与产品不匹配。
Notice that some prices may be missing, incorrect, or mismatched with products.

3471
06:18:46,048 --> 06:18:49,888
这个输出结果是“带条件的局部成功”的一个很好的例子。
This output is a great example of partial success with caveats.

3472
06:18:50,288 --> 06:18:56,196
智能体尝试从多个电商平台提取价格，这是一个复杂的任务。
The agent attempted to extract prices across multiple e commerce platforms, which is a complex task.

3473
06:18:56,528 --> 06:19:05,444
注意它明确说明了无法进行实时抓取，而是依赖于公开可用的列表、聚合器和报告价格。
Notice how it openly states that real time scraping is not possible and instead
relies on publicly available listings, aggregators, and reported prices.

3474
06:19:06,158 --> 06:19:13,712
同时观察一下广泛的价格范围，特别是对于我在这里
作为输入提供的 iPhone 和 MacBook 等旗舰产品。
Also observe the wide price range, especially for flagship products like iPhones and MacBooks, which I gave as an input here.

3475
06:19:14,094 --> 06:19:21,872
这是因为电商网站有动态定价、地区差异、第三方卖家以及频繁的折扣。
This happens because e-commerce sites have dynamic pricing, regional variations, third-party sellers, and frequent discounts.

3476
06:19:22,254 --> 06:19:27,552
智能体尽力去归一化这些数据，但输出结果明显显示出不一致性。
The agent does its best to normalize this, but the output clearly shows inconsistencies.

3477
06:19:27,982 --> 06:19:30,020
这给了我们一个重要的教训。
This teaches us an important lesson.

3478
06:19:30,382 --> 06:19:38,672
智能体非常适合进行近似比较和趋势分析，但不适合用于具有法律约束力或实时的价格决策。
Agents are excellent for approximate comparisons and trend level insights, but not for legally binding or real-time pricing decisions.

3479
06:19:39,022 --> 06:19:42,436
最终确认仍需要人工验证。
Human verification is still required for final confirmation.

3480
06:19:42,990 --> 06:19:45,552
智能体是按照接收到的指令来执行任务的。
Agents perform per the instructions they receive.

3481
06:19:45,806 --> 06:19:48,992
所以当指令很模糊时，输出结果也会很模糊。
So when instructions are shallow, outputs are also shallow.

3482
06:19:49,294 --> 06:19:50,756
所以你们可以在这里看到提示词。
So you can see the prompt here.

3483
06:19:51,118 --> 06:19:56,672
这个提示词要求生成一份报告，但没有定义结构、深度或预期目标。
This prompt asks for a report, but does not define the structure, depth, or expectations.

3484
06:19:57,102 --> 06:19:58,660
现在我来执行这个提示词。
Now I'll execute this prompt.

3485
06:19:59,022 --> 06:20:06,404
你会看到输出结果非常泛泛且不完整，这不是因为
智能体能力不足，而是因为指令本身缺乏清晰度。
You'll see the output is high level and incomplete, not because the agent lacks ability,
but because the instruction itself lacks clarity.

3486
06:20:07,054 --> 06:20:12,612
现在，这个输出看起来可能很出色，确实不错，但让我们仔细分析一下。
Now, this output might look impressive, and it is, but let's analyze it carefully.

3487
06:20:12,992 --> 06:20:24,900
智能体生成了一份非常长且全面的报告，涵盖了定义、类
型、示例、框架、应用场景、风险，甚至还有未来的展望。
The agent generated a very long, comprehensive report covering definitions,
types, examples, frameworks, use cases, risks, and even further outlook.

3488
06:20:25,312 --> 06:20:28,996
然而，请注意这里并没有给出任何结构限制。
However, notice that no structure constraints were given.

3489
06:20:29,552 --> 06:20:35,108
提示词里没说目标受众是谁，没说长度限制，也没说重点强调哪些区域。
No target audience, no length limit, no emphasis areas were told in the prompt.

3490
06:20:35,598 --> 06:20:41,700
结果就是，智能体产出了一份学术风格的报告，这对于某些受众来说可能太沉重了。
As a result, the agent produced an academic-style report, which may be too heavy for some audience.

3491
06:20:42,062 --> 06:20:43,232
这不是错误。
This is not an error.

3492
06:20:43,438 --> 06:20:46,660
这是在没有边界的宽泛目标下产生的自然结果。
It's a natural result of a broad goal without boundaries.

3493
06:20:47,086 --> 06:20:49,072
所以这里的教训很简单。
So the lesson here is simple.

3494
06:20:49,454 --> 06:20:55,332
当提示词缺乏结构时，智能体会倾向于最大覆盖范围，而不是最大相关性。
When prompts lack structure, agents defer to maximum coverage, not maximum relevance.

3495
06:20:55,790 --> 06:21:00,772
如果你想要简洁、可直接用于决策的输出，你必须明确要求。
If you want concise, decision-ready output, you must explicitly ask for it.

3496
06:21:01,678 --> 06:21:06,512
智能体模式很强大，但它在严格的安全和技术边界内运行。
Agent mode is powerful, but it operates with strict safety and technical boundaries.

3497
06:21:06,958 --> 06:21:09,636
让我们来看看你可能会遇到的一些常见限制。
Let's walk through some common limitations you'll encounter.

3498
06:21:10,222 --> 06:21:16,032
首先，智能体模式无法绕过 CAPTCHAS、登录表单或双重身份验证。
First, agent mode cannot bypass CAPTCHAS, login forms, or two-step authentication.

3499
06:21:16,430 --> 06:21:21,540
如果你指示它打开一个需要凭据的仪表板，它会停止并要求进一步说明。
If you instruct it to open a dashboard requiring credentials, it will stop and ask for clarification.

3500
06:21:22,350 --> 06:21:25,636
其次，它偶尔可能会误点 UI 元素。
Second, it may occasionally misclick UI elements.

3501
06:21:26,254 --> 06:21:31,908
例如，某个按钮或区域可能看起来和另一个元素很像，导致导航错误。
For example, a button or section may appear similar to another element, leading to incorrect navigation.

3502
06:21:32,526 --> 06:21:39,460
这是因为智能体是按视觉解析网页的，但可能无法完全理解其动态布局。
This is because the agent interprets web pages visually, but may not fully understand the dynamic layout of it.

3503
06:21:40,014 --> 06:21:44,912
智能体模式在处理大量 JavaScript 或高度交互的网站时也会遇到困难。
Agent mode also struggles with JavaScript-heavy or highly interactive websites.

3504
06:21:45,326 --> 06:21:53,380
动态加载内容、需要拖放操作或复杂菜单的页面可能会导致智能体错过关键元素。
Pages that load content dynamically or require drag and drop or complex menus can cause the agent to miss key elements.

3505
06:21:53,966 --> 06:21:58,032
它也无法进行后台监控或安排定时任务。
It also cannot perform background monitoring or schedule tasks.

3506
06:21:58,382 --> 06:22:05,072
例如，如果你要求它每天早上跟踪股价，如果没有外部自动化工具，这是无法实现的。
For example, if you ask it to track stock prices every morning, it's not possible without external automation tools.

3507
06:22:05,486 --> 06:22:08,548
智能体模式仅在当前任务窗口内运行。
Agent mode only acts during the current task window.

3508
06:22:09,198 --> 06:22:14,512
最后，智能体在沙箱中运行，这意味着文件系统访问受到限制。
Lastly, the agent operates in a sandbox, meaning file system access is restricted.

3509
06:22:14,766 --> 06:22:20,228
除非 ChatGPT 工具明确支持，否则它无法将文件下载到你的电脑上。
It cannot download files to your computer unless explicitly supported by ChatGPT tools.

3510
06:22:20,654 --> 06:22:27,268
这些限制是为了确保在不同网站和用户环境中的安全性、公平性和技术一致性。
These limitations exist to maintain safety, fairness, and technical consistency across websites and user environments.

3511
06:22:27,726 --> 06:22:30,912
现在让我给你们演示一下这些限制在现实中是如何体现的。
Now let me demonstrate all these limitations in reality for you.

3512
06:22:31,342 --> 06:22:36,100
智能体模式可以浏览，但它无法绕过 CAPTCHAS 甚至验证步骤。
Agent Mode can browse, but it cannot bypass captchas or even verification steps.

3513
06:22:36,942 --> 06:22:39,232
这是一个硬性的安全限制。
This is a hard safety limitation.

3514
06:22:39,566 --> 06:22:43,236
这个提示词将引导智能体进入一个受 CAPTCHAS 保护的网站。
This prompt will lead the agent to a site protected by CAPTCHAS.

3515
06:22:43,790 --> 06:22:50,191
我给出的网站 URL 是 cloudflare.com/products-products。
The site URL, which I have given here, is cloudflare.com forward slash products hyphen products.

3516
06:22:51,374 --> 06:22:52,512
现在我运行一下。
Now I'll run this.

3517
06:22:53,294 --> 06:22:57,732
注意看，出现了一个 CAPTCHA，智能体无法继续操作。
Notice that one CAPTCHA appears, the agent cannot proceed further.

3518
06:22:58,190 --> 06:23:03,172
正如预期的那样，智能体能够到达网站，但一旦出现 CAPTCHA 就停止了。
As expected, the agent was able to reach the website but stopped once the CAPTCHA appeared.

3519
06:23:03,758 --> 06:23:07,680
所以我尝试在不登录网站的情况下获取信息。
So I tried to fetch the information without logging into the website.

3520
06:23:07,982 --> 06:23:09,988
这展示了一个硬性的限制。
So this shows a hard limitation.

3521
06:23:10,446 --> 06:23:14,480
智能体模式无法解决或绕过人工验证步骤。
Agent mode cannot solve or bypass human verification steps.

3522
06:23:14,830 --> 06:23:18,756
任何依赖于完成 CAPTCHA 的工作流都会在这一步失败。
Any workflow that depends on CAPTCHA completion will fail at this point.

3523
06:23:19,534 --> 06:23:24,640
下一个限制是，智能体模式是按视觉识别 UI，而不是按语义理解。
Next limitation is that agent mode interprets UI visually, not semantically.

3524
06:23:25,038 --> 06:23:27,760
如果按钮看起来很相似，就可能会出错。
If a button looks similar, mistakes can happen.

3525
06:23:28,110 --> 06:23:32,560
虽然不一定每次都会发生，但在某些情况下可能会发生。
It may not be necessary every time it happens, but it may happen in some cases.

3526
06:23:32,910 --> 06:23:40,000
所以如你所见，这里的提示词并没有明确指导智能体优先处理哪些 UI 元素。
So as you can see the prompt here, this prompt does not guide the agent clearly on which UI elements to prioritize.

3527
06:23:40,334 --> 06:23:43,780
它只是说导航到网站并提取价格信息。
It just says navigate a website and extract pricing information.

3528
06:23:44,366 --> 06:23:45,680
我现在运行这个提示词。
I'll run this prompt now.

3529
06:23:45,998 --> 06:23:49,600
看看智能体可能会点击非预期的按钮或链接。
Watch how the agent may click unintended buttons or links.

3530
06:23:49,998 --> 06:23:58,500
这里，智能体尝试导航页面并点击正确的元素，尽
管有时它可能会点击错误的元素并走向错误的方案。
Here, the agent attempted to navigate the page and click the correct element,
though sometimes it might click unintended elements and go to the wrong solution.

3531
06:23:58,958 --> 06:24:10,080
由于智能体模式依赖于视觉模式而非语义理解，长相相似的按钮有时会造成混淆，
虽然在我刚才尝试执行时并非如此。
Since agent mode relies on visual patterns rather than semantic understanding, similar-looking buttons can confuse sometimes,
although it was not the case right now when I tried executing.

3532
06:24:10,414 --> 06:24:15,716
所以这突显了为什么在基于浏览器的提示词中，精确的 UI 指导至关重要。
So this highlights why precise UI guidance is critical in browser-based prompts.

3533
06:24:16,334 --> 06:24:20,720
一些现代网站高度依赖 JavaScript 来渲染内容。
Some modern websites rely heavily on JavaScript for rendering content.

3534
06:24:21,102 --> 06:24:25,040
智能体模式可能会无法正确加载或提取此类页面。
Agent mode may fail to load or extract such pages correctly.

3535
06:24:25,486 --> 06:24:31,556
如你所见，这个提示词将智能体发送到一个高度依赖 JavaScript 的页面，且没有备选指令。
As you can see in this prompt, this prompt sends the agent to a JavaScript heavy page without fallback instructions.

3536
06:24:32,046 --> 06:24:37,668
所以它要求导航的网站是 app.airtable.com 或 Figma.com。
So the website it is asking it to navigate is to app.airtable.com or Figma.com.

3537
06:24:38,094 --> 06:24:39,600
现在我运行这个提示词。
Now I will run this prompt.

3538
06:24:39,918 --> 06:24:43,120
你可能会注意到内容缺失或仅加载了一部分。
You may notice missing or partially loaded content.

3539
06:24:43,470 --> 06:24:47,440
智能体在完全加载或提取该页面的内容时遇到了困难。
The agent struggled to fully load or extract content from this page.

3540
06:24:47,790 --> 06:24:55,280
从输出中可以看到，高度依赖 JavaScript 的界面通常是动态渲染的，
智能体模式可能无法可靠地处理这种情况。
As you can see in the output, highly JavaScript-driven interfaces often render dynamically, which agent mode may not handle reliably.

3541
06:24:55,630 --> 06:25:00,068
因此，提取出的数据可能是不完整的，甚至完全缺失。
So as a result, the extracted data can be incomplete or missing entirely.

3542
06:25:00,718 --> 06:25:06,724
所以在这种情况下，内容完全缺失了，正如提到的那样，出现了网站不可用的消息。
So it is missing entirely in this case, as it is mentioned that the site unavailable message was there.

3543
06:25:07,200 --> 06:25:12,260
说到下一个局限性，智能体模式的记忆并不是无限的。
Talking about the next limitation, agent mode does not have unlimited memory.

3544
06:25:12,654 --> 06:25:16,480
长工作流也可能导致早期的上下文信息被遗忘。
Long workflows can cause earlier context to be forgotten as well.

3545
06:25:16,878 --> 06:25:23,760
所以你可以看到我正在使用的这个提示词，这个提
示词故意跨越了太多步骤，而且没有设置检查点。
So as you can see the prompt here, which I am using, this prompt intentionally spans too many steps without checkpoints.

3546
06:25:24,078 --> 06:25:31,440
正如我在这里提到的，执行一个跨越多个网站的长步骤研究任务，并在最后总结所有内容。
As I am mentioning here, perform a long multi-step research task across many websites and summarize everything at the end.

3547
06:25:31,822 --> 06:25:33,988
这里找不到合适的步骤。
There's no proper steps to find over here.

3548
06:25:34,766 --> 06:25:36,356
现在我来执行这个。
Now I will execute this.

3549
06:25:37,358 --> 06:25:43,280
所以你会注意到，在某些情况下，早期的细节可能会丢失或被糟糕地概括。
So you will notice how earlier details may be lost or summarized poorly in some cases.

3550
06:25:43,694 --> 06:25:50,000
所以在这个长步骤的多任务过程中，早期的细节要么被遗忘了，要么被过度概括了。
So during this long multi-step task, earlier details are either forgotten or overly summarized.

3551
06:25:50,318 --> 06:25:52,644
如你所见，它被过度概括了。
As you can see, it is overly summarized.

3552
06:25:53,390 --> 06:25:57,440
智能体模式在长工作流中具有有限的工作记忆。
Agent mode has limited working memory across extended workflows.

3553
06:25:57,678 --> 06:26:02,308
这使得它不适合在没有中间检查点的情况下运行长研究链。
This makes it unsuitable for long research chains without intermediate checkpoints.

3554
06:26:03,040 --> 06:26:05,440
智能体模式仅在会话中运行。
Agent Mode works in session only.

3555
06:26:05,710 --> 06:26:08,720
它无法在后台持续运行任务。
It cannot run tasks continuously in the background.

3556
06:26:09,070 --> 06:26:12,320
这是另一个局限性，我将向你们演示一下。
This is another limitation, which I am going to demonstrate it to you.

3557
06:26:12,686 --> 06:26:19,680
所以你可以看到这里的提示词，这个提示词要求持续执行，而智能体模式无法支持。
So as you can see the prompt here, this prompt requests ongoing execution, which agent mode cannot support.

3558
06:26:20,142 --> 06:26:22,436
让我们看看输出中实际发生了什么。
Let us actually see what happens in the output.

3559
06:26:22,926 --> 06:26:25,040
现在我来执行这个提示词。
So I will execute this prompt now.

3560
06:26:25,454 --> 06:26:31,280
在我看来，智能体应该解释它无法执行持久或定时安排的后台任务。
So according to me, the agent should explain that it cannot perform persistent or scheduled background tasks.

3561
06:26:31,630 --> 06:26:33,572
让我们看看最后得到了什么输出。
Let us see what output we get at the end.

3562
06:26:34,080 --> 06:26:39,364
智能体明确表示它无法持续监控网站或按计划运行。
The agent clearly states that it cannot monitor websites continuously or run on a schedule.

3563
06:26:39,982 --> 06:26:43,200
智能体模式仅在活跃会话中运行。
Agent mode operates only within the active session.

3564
06:26:43,502 --> 06:26:48,996
任何关于后台执行或定期监控的要求都在它的能力范围之外。
Any requirement for background execution or periodic monitoring is outside its capability.

3565
06:26:49,678 --> 06:26:52,900
如你所见，输出中也明确提到了这一点。
As you can see, it is also clearly mentioned in the output.

3566
06:26:53,454 --> 06:26:57,700
为了确保你的智能体运行可靠，请遵循这些最佳实践。
To ensure your agents perform reliably, follow these best practices.

3567
06:26:58,190 --> 06:27:03,920
第一点也是最重要的规则是创建清晰、结构化的提示词，这一点非常重要。
The first and most important role is to create clear, structured prompts, which are very important.

3568
06:27:04,462 --> 06:27:07,588
当智能体明确知道你想要什么时，它们的表现最好。
Agents perform best when they know exactly what you want.

3569
06:27:08,206 --> 06:27:11,520
接下来是将复杂的任务分解成更小的部分。
Next is to break the complex task into smaller parts.

3570
06:27:11,854 --> 06:27:20,548
与其一次性要求生成完整的报告，不如先从收集资料或提取关键点开始，然后再生成摘要。
Instead of asking for a complete report in one go, start with like gather
sources, or maybe extract key points, and then generate the summary.

3571
06:27:21,294 --> 06:27:25,200
提供预期的输出示例可以显著提高质量。
Providing examples of expected output dramatically improves quality.

3572
06:27:25,486 --> 06:27:31,556
无论是示例表格、写作风格还是幻灯片格式，智能体都会将其作为蓝图。
Whether it is a sample table, a writing style, or a slide format, the agent uses this as a blueprint.

3573
06:27:32,174 --> 06:27:35,840
添加检查点可以确保智能体在逻辑间隔处暂停。
Adding checkpoints ensures the agent pauses at logical intervals.

3574
06:27:36,080 --> 06:27:39,940
这可以防止重大错误，并让你掌控工作流的方向。
This prevents major errors and gives you control over workflow directions.

3575
06:27:40,430 --> 06:27:46,116
最后，始终要求智能体在开始执行前说明它的假设。
Finally, always ask the agent to state its assumptions before beginning execution.

3576
06:27:46,574 --> 06:27:50,660
这一步能及早发现误解，从而节省时间。
This one step catches misunderstandings early and saves time.

3577
06:27:51,566 --> 06:27:58,512
这些实践共同减少了错误，提高了一致性，并创造出流畅的智能体 AI 工作流。
These practices collectively reduce errors, improve consistency, and create smooth agentic workflow.

3578
06:27:58,672 --> 06:28:01,604
这就是本智能体 AI 课程的全部内容。
And that's a wrap on this Agentic AI course.

3579
06:28:01,792 --> 06:28:03,428
让我们回顾一下你学到的内容。
Let's recap what you've covered.

3580
06:28:03,790 --> 06:28:10,180
你首先了解了什么是智能体 AI，以及它是如何让 AI 从简单任务转向真正的自主性的。
You started with what Agentic AI is and how it moves AI from simple tasks to real autonomy.

3581
06:28:10,478 --> 06:28:16,356
你学习了核心构建模块、设计模式、工具以及 AI 智能体的关键特征。
You learned the core building blocks, design patterns, tools, and the key traits of an AI agent.

3582
06:28:16,686 --> 06:28:22,592
然后你使用 Langchain 进行构建，从 PDF 中提取见解，并学会了如何处理幻觉。
Then you built with Langchain, extracted insights from PDFs, and learned to handle hallucinations.

3583
06:28:22,894 --> 06:28:36,420
你利用 LangGraph 创建了智能体和多智能体工作流，使用 Azure OpenAI 构建了数据库智能体，
最后学习了 ChatGPT 的智能体模式和 AutoGPT，包括如何编写有效的目标以及它们的局限性。
You created agents and multi-agent workflows with Langgraph, built a database agent with Azure OpenAI,
and finished with ChatGPT's Agent Mode and AutoGPT, including how to write effective goals and where the limits are.

3584
06:28:36,672 --> 06:28:41,952
你现在既掌握了概念，又有实操经验来开始自己构建智能体。
You now have both the concepts and the hands on experience to start building agents yourself.

3585
06:28:42,158 --> 06:28:44,420
这是我对下一步行动的建议。
Here's my suggestion for what to do next.

3586
06:28:44,752 --> 06:28:50,112
从你的工作或个人项目中找出一个真实问题，并为它构建一个智能体。
Pick one real problem from your work or your own projects and build an agent for it.

3587
06:28:50,382 --> 06:28:52,112
只有这样，这些知识才能真正内化。
That's how this knowledge sticks.

3588
06:28:52,531 --> 06:28:54,631
感谢观看，我们下期再见！
Thanks for watching, and I'll see you in the next one!

